WEBVTT

00:18.059 --> 00:18.893
SEOUL
APRIL 2021

00:18.977 --> 00:21.938
Apartment prices in Seoul are setting
record highs for the 40th week running.

00:22.022 --> 00:23.440
In response to the skyrocketing prices,

00:23.523 --> 00:26.901
the government has forecast
heavy-handed loan regulations.

00:26.985 --> 00:29.279
All-in buyers are maxing out
everything they have,

00:29.362 --> 00:32.115
fearing this is their last chance
to own a property in Seoul…

00:32.198 --> 00:35.827
Do you think I'm late on purpose?
I told you, I took time off work for this.

00:35.910 --> 00:37.328
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:37.412 --> 00:38.496
I'm right out front.

00:38.580 --> 00:41.082
I'll be there in one minute.
Just one minute!

00:45.295 --> 00:46.421
1.1 billion won?

00:46.504 --> 00:49.299
But you said 1.09 billion.

00:49.382 --> 00:51.009
And that was just an hour ago.

00:51.092 --> 00:52.552
Take it or leave it.

00:52.635 --> 00:55.388
It feels like a waste for me
to sell it anyway.

00:55.889 --> 00:58.099
There are others waiting in line.

00:58.183 --> 00:59.100
What will it be?

01:14.908 --> 01:17.535
NOH WOO-SUNG

01:19.329 --> 01:20.997
Congratulations. You're a homeowner.

01:21.081 --> 01:23.333
Here are the loan documents
you need to complete.

01:24.250 --> 01:25.418
I'd like a credit loan!

01:26.252 --> 01:27.879
LOAN APPROVED
SAVINGS ACCOUNT CLOSED

01:29.130 --> 01:30.298
SELL ALL

01:30.381 --> 01:31.716
META COIN
CONFIRM SALE

01:34.511 --> 01:35.720
CASH SALE

01:35.804 --> 01:36.888
SELL

01:36.971 --> 01:40.433
Assistant Manager Noh here
now owns an apartment in Seoul!

01:40.517 --> 01:43.103
He pooled everything.
The staff loan and early severance!

01:43.186 --> 01:44.187
MORTGAGE LOAN 2.28%

01:46.648 --> 01:47.565
Congrats. You deserve it.

01:47.649 --> 01:49.109
RENTAL DEPOSIT RETURNED
30 MILLION WON

01:49.192 --> 01:50.360
Thank you for everything.

01:56.658 --> 01:58.993
Land for sale!

01:59.661 --> 02:00.954
Over here!

02:01.037 --> 02:02.330
I'll transfer the money now.

02:02.413 --> 02:03.581
Much appreciated.

02:05.500 --> 02:07.627
That's everything!

02:08.336 --> 02:10.421
- It's already up by 140 million.
- It is?

02:11.047 --> 02:12.507
Hey, slow down!

02:20.932 --> 02:22.100
- Is that it?
- Over there!

02:22.600 --> 02:23.434
That's our home.

02:26.271 --> 02:27.772
This is our home?

02:27.856 --> 02:29.524
It's perfect.

02:40.827 --> 02:45.248
PROPERTY REGISTRATION NOTICE
HOLDER: NOH WOO-SUNG

02:45.331 --> 02:48.001
UNIT SIZE: 84.98 SQUARE METERS

03:00.388 --> 03:07.395
WALL TO WALL

03:08.146 --> 03:13.401
AUGUST 2024
SEOUL

03:17.655 --> 03:21.201
OVERDUE MAINTENANCE FEE
PAYMENT DEMAND NOTICE

03:41.304 --> 03:43.431
TUESDAY, AUGUST 6

04:18.383 --> 04:21.344
ROYAL CITY SILEO
URGENT SALE 870 MILLION WON

04:22.762 --> 04:26.307
There's been an overflow of urgent sales
due to the dip in housing prices,

04:26.391 --> 04:28.518
but the reality is
that Seoul apartment prices

04:28.601 --> 04:30.687
have always climbed in the end.

04:30.770 --> 04:32.730
Hold tight, and they'll eventually rise.

04:32.814 --> 04:35.692
Especially you all-in buyers.
I know it's tough for you.

04:35.775 --> 04:37.318
YOUR LOAN INTEREST RATE
ADJUSTED FROM 16.87% TO 18.18%

04:37.902 --> 04:39.404
But you must not give up.

04:39.487 --> 04:41.948
Sell now, and I guarantee
you'll regret it forever.

04:49.664 --> 04:50.790
FAREWELL, STRUCK CRYPTO GOLD!

04:50.873 --> 04:52.750
Is everyone coming to have beef tonight?

04:52.834 --> 04:55.712
- I wouldn't miss it, bro.
- Man, I'm so freaking jealous.

04:57.005 --> 04:59.382
"I wish I bought crypto, too,
not an apartment."

04:59.924 --> 05:01.426
"I'm so damn jealous."

05:02.427 --> 05:03.511
Sorry?

05:04.012 --> 05:07.348
No, it's just…
I could hear what you were thinking.

05:08.182 --> 05:10.184
Oh, I wasn't thinking that.

05:10.268 --> 05:12.895
Guys like him
who just happen to get a lucky break

05:12.979 --> 05:15.231
give everyone else unrealistic ideas.

05:15.315 --> 05:18.609
Idiots risk their life savings
and take out unaffordable loans,

05:18.693 --> 05:20.111
thinking they can hit it big.

05:22.071 --> 05:24.240
No wonder the economy's so screwed

05:24.324 --> 05:26.617
with all those investment
and speculation junkies.

05:28.328 --> 05:29.245
Don't you agree?

05:29.871 --> 05:31.247
Well, yes.

05:31.331 --> 05:34.542
But I'm not a speculator.
I actually live in my apartment.

05:34.625 --> 05:36.419
Oh, you do?

05:36.502 --> 05:37.337
Yes.

05:38.963 --> 05:40.256
A proud house poor here, huh?

05:41.883 --> 05:42.717
Sir.

05:44.344 --> 05:47.180
But still, you went from just poor
to house poor.

05:47.263 --> 05:49.724
That's a step up, isn't it?

05:50.600 --> 05:53.770
Good grief. Will he ever step up at work?

06:04.822 --> 06:05.990
Suck it up, man.

06:06.532 --> 06:08.618
It sucks, but you've got loans to pay.

06:10.661 --> 06:11.996
History proves

06:12.747 --> 06:14.957
that Seoul apartment prices only go up.

06:15.666 --> 06:16.751
Just watch me.

06:16.834 --> 06:21.214
I'll hold out until Cho fucking croaks
of jealousy, that dipshit.

06:21.714 --> 06:23.716
You sure you can last that long?

06:23.800 --> 06:25.843
You pay more every month than you earn.

06:27.261 --> 06:30.264
What, you want me to sell the apartment?
What if prices rise?

06:30.890 --> 06:32.642
And what if they keep tanking?

06:34.310 --> 06:35.269
Asshole.

06:36.270 --> 06:38.606
Come on. It's about time you gave up.

06:38.689 --> 06:40.400
You held out for long enough.

06:42.735 --> 06:44.404
I couldn't sell if I wanted to.

06:44.904 --> 06:46.322
Let alone find a renter.

06:46.406 --> 06:48.699
It wouldn't have been so bad
with two incomes.

06:48.783 --> 06:51.285
I told you not to call off your wedding.

06:51.369 --> 06:54.330
Hey, I thought that topic was off-limits.

06:55.456 --> 06:57.208
I'm just worried about you.

06:58.000 --> 07:01.170
You look like shit.
Would it kill you to shave every so often?

07:01.712 --> 07:03.464
My noisy neighbors are keeping me up.

07:03.548 --> 07:05.049
Oh, right. Hey.

07:05.716 --> 07:08.511
Are you going to Seo's farewell dinner?

07:08.594 --> 07:10.972
You should. He's buying everyone beef.

07:11.055 --> 07:12.557
Can't. Gotta make money.

07:12.640 --> 07:15.935
That debt won't go anywhere
with that part-time gig of yours.

07:17.186 --> 07:21.190
We should get Seo shit-faced
and suck some investment tips out of him.

07:21.274 --> 07:22.525
- Investment?
- Yup.

07:23.192 --> 07:26.279
Does Seo remind you
of all the crypto you had to cash out?

07:27.196 --> 07:29.490
I thought that was also off-limits.

07:30.074 --> 07:31.576
Just worried about you, bud.

07:32.535 --> 07:34.078
Look at this face.

07:34.162 --> 07:36.747
- You call this a fucking face?
- Shut up, House Poor.

07:36.831 --> 07:38.458
Whatever, Crypto Poor.

07:47.341 --> 07:50.678
- Let's get going.
- When will I win big with crypto and quit?

07:50.761 --> 07:54.849
I'm not even asking to get rich.
I just want to stop working so late.

07:54.932 --> 07:55.933
You're right.

08:21.626 --> 08:24.420
GREENLIGHT THE GTX-K LINE
NOGANG STATION NOW!

08:30.259 --> 08:32.428
NOISE BETWEEN FLOORS
BE A CONSIDERATE NEIGHBOR

08:41.646 --> 08:44.649
MY 12TH AND 8TH-GRADERS
ARE VERY SENSITIVE, PLEASE KEEP IT DOWN

09:09.215 --> 09:10.925
MAINTENANCE OFFICE
CONNECTING…

09:12.426 --> 09:14.053
Hello, this is maintenance.

09:14.136 --> 09:15.846
Hello, it's Apartment 1401.

09:16.347 --> 09:18.099
They're being noisy again upstairs.

09:18.182 --> 09:21.018
I've tried calling,
but they won't answer their intercom.

09:21.102 --> 09:24.438
Well, instead of just calling them
over the intercom,

09:24.522 --> 09:27.567
could you try going over there
and talking to them in person?

09:27.650 --> 09:29.569
Well, all right. I understand.

09:29.652 --> 09:31.112
I'll look into it right away.

09:32.446 --> 09:33.906
Wait, one second.

09:33.990 --> 09:37.660
The downstairs neighbors
keep leaving notes on my door.

09:38.160 --> 09:39.495
Tell them it's not me.

09:39.579 --> 09:40.413
Sure.

10:01.142 --> 10:02.101
Hello.

10:52.234 --> 10:55.237
MY CHILDREN CAN'T STUDY
PLEASE KEEP THE NOISE DOWN

11:13.172 --> 11:16.926
It only took five seconds
for the 16 floors to collapse.

11:17.009 --> 11:19.387
Signs of poor construction
were found all over…

11:19.470 --> 11:20.638
REVENGE ON NEIGHBORS

11:23.391 --> 11:25.434
740,000 LIKES

11:35.611 --> 11:37.196
WEDNESDAY, AUGUST 7

12:03.222 --> 12:04.932
FRONT DOOR

12:12.815 --> 12:14.024
What are you doing?

12:18.404 --> 12:19.989
I live downstairs.

12:21.240 --> 12:23.117
I guess you didn't see this.

12:23.617 --> 12:25.995
I'm telling you, it's not me.

12:27.079 --> 12:28.664
Didn't maintenance tell you?

12:30.666 --> 12:32.168
Oh no. Are you okay?

12:32.668 --> 12:33.627
I'm sorry.

12:34.628 --> 12:35.629
Are you okay?

12:39.633 --> 12:40.468
What the…

12:41.469 --> 12:43.137
What on earth are you doing?

12:43.220 --> 12:46.015
My daughter is a senior,
and my son is in 8th grade.

12:46.098 --> 12:48.893
You know how it is.
They're so very sensitive.

12:48.976 --> 12:52.354
The kids need their sleep,
and it's just so noisy through the night.

12:54.106 --> 12:55.649
I wrote it all down for you.

12:55.733 --> 12:58.736
I'm telling you,
the noises aren't from my place.

13:00.821 --> 13:03.324
I just woke up
because of the noise myself.

13:05.201 --> 13:08.704
Seriously, how many times
must I tell you it's not me?

13:10.539 --> 13:12.124
My husband says…

13:16.003 --> 13:18.172
he's certain the noises
are from your place.

13:22.384 --> 13:23.552
Well, he's wrong.

13:24.136 --> 13:25.179
So seriously,

13:25.262 --> 13:27.807
stop leaving these notes on my door.

13:36.816 --> 13:39.193
It only gets noisy when you're home.

13:40.611 --> 13:41.612
What are you doing?

13:41.695 --> 13:43.280
You listen carefully.

13:44.365 --> 13:47.076
You don't want my husband to come up here.

13:47.868 --> 13:49.161
Are you

13:49.954 --> 13:51.747
threatening me right now?

13:53.541 --> 13:55.251
I'm just expressing my concern.

13:57.461 --> 13:59.129
Seriously, lady.

13:59.213 --> 14:01.549
I told you it's not me.
It's not from my place.

14:01.632 --> 14:04.635
The vibrations and footsteps.
They're all coming from upstairs.

14:04.718 --> 14:06.554
Want to come in and hear for yourself?

14:08.430 --> 14:09.890
Hey, hold on. Just wait.

14:09.974 --> 14:11.100
Excuse me.

14:11.892 --> 14:13.811
What the hell? Are you insane?

14:13.894 --> 14:15.479
Can you not run up my bill?

14:15.563 --> 14:16.605
Shoes.

14:17.106 --> 14:18.065
Your shoes!

14:18.566 --> 14:19.441
Get out.

14:20.818 --> 14:21.777
It's silent.

14:25.239 --> 14:26.073
No, wait.

14:26.574 --> 14:28.367
It was really noisy a moment ago.

14:31.203 --> 14:34.248
This rude little shit won't even admit it.

14:36.375 --> 14:38.460
You look down on us
because we rent, don't you?

14:38.961 --> 14:39.920
Sorry?

14:40.004 --> 14:41.463
Look, lady. What did you say?

14:42.756 --> 14:44.633
I've put up with enough.

14:45.968 --> 14:48.220
Yeah, well…
What are you gonna do about it?

14:56.979 --> 14:57.938
What the hell.

15:02.109 --> 15:04.862
What the actual fuck?
Are they doing this on purpose?

15:27.509 --> 15:28.344
Can I help you?

15:31.847 --> 15:32.681
Hello.

15:33.182 --> 15:35.225
I live downstairs. Apartment 1401.

15:36.143 --> 15:37.102
Yes, and?

15:37.645 --> 15:38.479
The thing is,

15:38.562 --> 15:42.733
my downstairs neighbors at 1301
keep making complaints.

15:45.069 --> 15:48.322
Their kids are in 12th and 8th grade.
You must know they're tough years.

15:49.239 --> 15:50.324
So?

15:51.700 --> 15:53.869
Perhaps I should have been clearer.

15:54.453 --> 15:58.624
Your phone can vibrate really loudly
if you leave it on the floor.

15:58.707 --> 16:01.543
The sound of moving furniture
or your footsteps, and…

16:01.627 --> 16:05.631
You must work out.
The sound of you working out is very loud.

16:06.131 --> 16:07.007
You sure about that?

16:09.301 --> 16:11.053
It's been a few months now.

16:11.136 --> 16:14.098
It just so happens that the noises
started after you moved in.

16:14.181 --> 16:16.767
So you were living quietly,
but ever since I moved in,

16:16.850 --> 16:19.853
your downstairs neighbors
have been complaining about noises?

16:20.729 --> 16:21.563
Yes.

16:21.647 --> 16:24.108
I imagine that would be
annoying and frustrating.

16:24.692 --> 16:27.361
Well, you know…
Thank you for understanding.

16:27.444 --> 16:29.196
That's exactly how I feel right now.

16:29.947 --> 16:30.781
Sorry?

16:30.864 --> 16:34.994
I was sound asleep when the guy downstairs
came up to tell me to be quiet.

16:37.037 --> 16:38.414
Oh, that's…

16:39.123 --> 16:41.583
- Did maintenance--
- I already told them it wasn't me.

16:43.252 --> 16:45.796
I should have
looked into it properly first.

16:46.296 --> 16:49.008
I guess I've made the same mistake.
Sorry to disturb you.

16:50.801 --> 16:54.513
If you're so sorry,
why don't you talk to the people upstairs?

16:54.596 --> 16:55.973
Sorry, me?

16:56.056 --> 16:58.559
It's so damn loud every night.

16:58.642 --> 17:01.186
Tell them they'll regret it
if they keep it up.

17:01.270 --> 17:03.188
Do you think it's the people upstairs?

17:03.272 --> 17:05.357
If it's not you or me,
who else could it be?

17:05.441 --> 17:06.608
Appreciate it.

17:09.486 --> 17:11.113
I said I was sorry.

17:11.196 --> 17:13.866
My phone was on vibrate,
so I missed my alarm.

17:16.452 --> 17:18.454
Yeah. I'm almost there now.

17:18.537 --> 17:20.372
Okay. See you.

17:23.751 --> 17:24.835
You scared me.

17:25.961 --> 17:28.297
I live on the 14th floor. Two floors down.

17:28.380 --> 17:29.965
Right.

17:30.466 --> 17:31.592
Can I help you?

17:36.305 --> 17:38.057
Do you really not know why I'm here?

17:38.140 --> 17:40.267
The kids should be asleep by now.

17:40.350 --> 17:42.061
And we have mats all over the floor.

17:42.603 --> 17:44.063
What good is that gonna…

17:44.563 --> 17:46.523
NOISE-FREE HOME
IMPACT NOISE MATS INSTALLED

17:49.318 --> 17:52.029
The vibrations from your alarms
are really loud.

17:52.112 --> 17:55.741
What are you talking about?
I can't set alarms. They'd wake my kids.

17:55.824 --> 17:57.076
Oh, come on.

17:57.159 --> 18:00.245
I heard you saying something
about alarms just now.

18:00.829 --> 18:02.664
So you were eavesdropping?

18:03.290 --> 18:06.960
You were talking so loud at this hour.
Of course I heard you.

18:07.044 --> 18:10.214
I missed the alarm
because I didn't set one.

18:11.006 --> 18:11.840
Sorry?

18:14.134 --> 18:17.179
I just said I missed it
as an excuse for being late.

18:18.597 --> 18:19.431
Really?

18:20.140 --> 18:23.352
I'd rather not talk about people
behind their backs,

18:23.852 --> 18:25.437
but the noise is from upstairs.

18:25.521 --> 18:26.855
You mean the 17th floor?

18:26.939 --> 18:28.941
Yes. They wake up super early.

18:29.024 --> 18:33.028
No way that noise would reach all the way
to my place. I live on the 14th floor.

18:33.112 --> 18:35.280
You should check it out yourself, then.

18:41.245 --> 18:43.163
MEMBER OF THE MINSEONG CHURCH CONGREGATION

18:51.588 --> 18:52.548
Who's there?

18:53.215 --> 18:55.592
Hello, sir. I live on the 14th floor.

18:55.676 --> 18:57.261
Three floors down.

18:57.344 --> 18:59.054
I see. Come on in, kid.

19:04.017 --> 19:05.269
Jesus, let us…

19:05.352 --> 19:06.854
What's wrong with this mutt?

19:07.604 --> 19:08.856
Take it inside.

19:08.939 --> 19:10.941
…serve your neighbor…

19:13.110 --> 19:14.653
Never seen a walker before?

19:19.032 --> 19:19.950
Hello, sir.

19:20.033 --> 19:23.287
What brings you all the way up here
at the crack of dawn?

19:23.871 --> 19:25.622
Because of the noises, sir.

19:25.706 --> 19:27.833
It's been causing us
quite some discomfort.

19:27.916 --> 19:30.043
It'd be great if you could keep it down.

19:30.127 --> 19:31.128
Noises?

19:31.211 --> 19:33.005
But I can barely walk.

19:33.630 --> 19:35.591
The noises just happen to be heard

19:35.674 --> 19:39.261
right around the time
you're awake in the… early mornings.

19:39.344 --> 19:40.971
Especially your phone vibrating.

19:41.054 --> 19:41.930
Do you have proof?

19:42.556 --> 19:43.807
Proof, sir?

19:43.891 --> 19:46.268
It's depressing enough
to be sitting around all day.

19:46.351 --> 19:49.146
Now you're calling me
a noisy old man with no proof?

19:49.813 --> 19:52.357
I can't even move around properly
because of my legs!

19:53.567 --> 19:54.735
It's not that. I just--

19:54.818 --> 19:56.445
Back in my day,

19:57.029 --> 19:59.156
everyone knew who lived where.

19:59.239 --> 20:01.950
We were all understanding
and considerate of each other.

20:02.034 --> 20:04.328
People live here. They make noise!

20:04.912 --> 20:06.955
- Well, so does your dog.
- That's absurd!

20:07.539 --> 20:10.375
You can hear Ddungi down there?
Our walls aren't made of paper!

20:11.418 --> 20:13.754
Unless a person's barking,
it must be your dog.

20:13.837 --> 20:18.050
If you have so many complaints,
take it up with the one upstairs!

20:18.133 --> 20:20.677
How much further up must I go, sir?

20:20.761 --> 20:23.847
Go and file a formal complaint
with the resident representative!

20:49.831 --> 20:51.124
Damn it.

20:56.922 --> 20:58.757
PENTHOUSE

21:05.138 --> 21:06.056
Shit.

21:10.686 --> 21:12.062
1401, right?

21:15.023 --> 21:18.360
Yes, hello. Do you know me?

21:18.443 --> 21:20.654
I got a call on the intercom
from downstairs.

21:21.154 --> 21:22.864
You want the resident representative?

21:24.825 --> 21:26.535
Would you like to come in?

21:38.046 --> 21:41.383
So you came all the way here
from the 14th floor because of the noise?

21:41.466 --> 21:42.426
Yes.

21:42.509 --> 21:46.221
Everyone kept telling me to go upstairs,
and I ended up here. I'm sorry.

21:46.888 --> 21:48.974
Why do people always think it's upstairs?

21:50.267 --> 21:52.144
This building uses a load-bearing system,

21:52.644 --> 21:55.188
so the walls are connected
as one continuous unit.

21:55.272 --> 21:58.400
How could anyone tell if the noise
was coming from above or below?

21:58.984 --> 22:02.779
So you're saying
the building itself is the problem?

22:03.613 --> 22:06.616
The building's not to blame.
Ultimately, people are the problem.

22:07.284 --> 22:08.285
Right, of course.

22:08.827 --> 22:11.621
My downstairs neighbors
keep leaving notes on my door.

22:11.705 --> 22:13.790
It's so unfair. I'm about to go insane.

22:15.500 --> 22:16.960
I can take care of that.

22:18.086 --> 22:19.713
I own Apartment 1301.

22:21.590 --> 22:23.050
So you're their landlord?

22:23.133 --> 22:26.428
I'll get them out when their lease is up.
Can you give me two months?

22:27.346 --> 22:29.806
If you're the landlord,
can't you just talk to them?

22:29.890 --> 22:32.642
You can't expect me
to just wait for two whole months.

22:32.726 --> 22:35.062
Here. Consider this compensation.

22:35.145 --> 22:36.730
No, I can't accept…

22:38.607 --> 22:41.443
I'm not just their landlord.

22:41.526 --> 22:43.362
I'm the resident representative.

22:44.279 --> 22:47.699
I intend to get the weirdos
from this apartment complex,

22:48.200 --> 22:50.077
so I'd appreciate your cooperation.

22:52.537 --> 22:54.539
I guess that's just how it is.

22:54.623 --> 22:57.459
It did cross my mind
that where people live,

22:57.542 --> 23:00.087
there's bound to be some noise.

23:00.170 --> 23:03.882
I knew we homeowners
would be on the same page.

23:03.965 --> 23:06.676
Oh, not at all.
It's only my place on paper, really.

23:07.177 --> 23:08.261
I maxed out my loans.

23:08.345 --> 23:11.431
Not everyone qualifies for loans.
You need to be capable.

23:12.015 --> 23:14.518
No, I'm really not that capable.

23:15.811 --> 23:16.895
What's your name?

23:17.729 --> 23:18.897
It's Noh Woo-sung.

23:18.980 --> 23:20.232
Do you live alone?

23:20.315 --> 23:22.359
At the moment, yes.

23:22.859 --> 23:24.778
I live alone, yes.

23:26.154 --> 23:27.697
Can't be easy to hold out.

23:28.740 --> 23:33.161
You can't sell since it might go up,
but no one wants to rent either.

23:33.245 --> 23:35.914
People around you are probably
giving you judgmental looks.

23:36.998 --> 23:38.250
Let's hang in there

23:38.875 --> 23:40.419
for a little while longer.

23:40.919 --> 23:43.463
Things will get better
once the GTX line comes in.

23:43.964 --> 23:46.299
Do you really think
the GTX will come through?

23:46.925 --> 23:48.009
Of course.

23:48.593 --> 23:51.096
This is a crucial time
for our apartment complex.

23:51.596 --> 23:53.557
We don't want any ruckus.

23:55.308 --> 23:56.476
You get what I mean,

23:57.185 --> 23:58.019
don't you?

23:58.103 --> 23:59.020
Yes.

23:59.646 --> 24:00.605
Yes, ma'am.

24:01.189 --> 24:02.858
It's for the good of the complex.

24:02.941 --> 24:05.235
I'll do my best to stick it out.

24:20.500 --> 24:22.586
You gotta be shitting me.

24:26.882 --> 24:28.341
That's fucking creepy.

24:29.551 --> 24:31.928
Shouldn't you take it
to the police at this point?

24:32.012 --> 24:33.722
For blackmail or stalking.

24:33.805 --> 24:37.851
What if I just provoke them even more?
Our representative said we should lay low.

24:37.934 --> 24:39.728
And a little cash has shut you up?

24:39.811 --> 24:43.273
Well, she gave me enough money
to cover my interest, so, yeah,

24:43.356 --> 24:44.232
I can't complain.

24:44.316 --> 24:46.109
That cash would barely make a dent.

24:47.611 --> 24:48.820
Don't get started, okay?

24:50.155 --> 24:52.574
Just forget it.
I was only looking out for you.

24:54.075 --> 24:56.411
- What is it?
- You're not interested. Forget it.

24:56.495 --> 24:58.246
- What is it?
- Want to know?

24:58.330 --> 24:59.289
A little.

25:01.082 --> 25:04.294
Okay, so last night,
I got Seo totally shit-faced

25:04.377 --> 25:06.171
and found out
about his crypto signal group.

25:06.671 --> 25:07.964
Dude!

25:08.048 --> 25:10.550
You should watch out
for that kind of shit!

25:10.634 --> 25:12.135
I bet it's some pump-and-dump--

25:12.219 --> 25:13.345
What the fuck, dude?

25:13.428 --> 25:14.262
Come here.

25:14.971 --> 25:17.015
- Just get over here.
- Fucking gross.

25:17.599 --> 25:19.100
Here. Look.

25:19.893 --> 25:24.523
Tonight at midnight,
GB Coin will bottom out at 815 won.

25:24.606 --> 25:26.233
After that, it will rebound,

25:26.316 --> 25:29.986
hitting its peak of 815%
on Liberation Day, August 15.

25:30.070 --> 25:31.696
After that, it will tank.

25:32.197 --> 25:35.784
Wait, so you would buy in at 815 won
for an 815% return?

25:35.867 --> 25:36.743
Yeah.

25:36.826 --> 25:39.788
- And GB means gwangbok, as in liberation?
- Exactly, man.

25:39.871 --> 25:43.542
An 815% return means walking away
with nine times your investment.

25:44.292 --> 25:45.460
Nine times?

25:45.544 --> 25:47.796
You fucking moron. You believe that?

25:48.630 --> 25:50.465
Look at last week's pump-and-dump.

25:50.966 --> 25:54.219
Rora Coin. They got it down to 500 won,
then pumped it up to five times.

25:54.302 --> 25:56.721
This is how Seo made his money.

25:59.015 --> 26:00.934
But this is a scheme.

26:01.434 --> 26:03.186
Isn't it illegal? It's risky.

26:03.770 --> 26:05.480
You're doing just fine, are you?

26:05.564 --> 26:08.066
Whatever. I don't need to convince you.

26:09.234 --> 26:11.403
This is priceless intel.

26:11.486 --> 26:12.946
What a dimwit.

26:13.029 --> 26:14.739
No, it's not that.

26:15.699 --> 26:17.033
I have no seed money.

26:17.117 --> 26:19.244
Even if I wanted to invest, I couldn't.

26:19.327 --> 26:23.456
This is a 100% win.
Get a private loan if you must.

26:23.540 --> 26:24.416
A private loan?

26:24.916 --> 26:26.585
You want me to rack up more debt?

26:26.668 --> 26:29.796
Excuse me?
This is your way out of your debt.

26:29.879 --> 26:32.257
Say you get 80 million.
Eight times nine is 72.

26:32.340 --> 26:35.343
You could pay off that 700 million
and still have 20 left.

26:36.094 --> 26:38.013
Forget it. I'm already stretched thin.

26:38.096 --> 26:41.308
I'm not taking out a private loan
over some baseless info.

26:42.100 --> 26:43.184
That's ridiculous!

26:43.268 --> 26:46.229
MR. NOH WOO-SUNG,
YOU ARE INELIGIBLE FOR AN URGENT LOAN

26:56.406 --> 26:58.408
JEON YEONG-SEOK HERE
HEARD YOU NEED FAST CASH

26:58.491 --> 27:00.869
YOU'RE MAXED OUT,
SO YOUR APARTMENT CAN BE COLLATERAL

27:05.248 --> 27:07.083
Get it together, you idiot.

27:17.177 --> 27:19.596
GB COIN

27:52.796 --> 27:53.630
Hey!

28:05.892 --> 28:06.893
Goddamn it.

28:10.480 --> 28:12.148
Yes. I'm so sorry.

28:12.732 --> 28:15.610
It was my fault, yes.
I'll transfer you the money.

28:16.111 --> 28:17.237
Yes, I'm sorry.

28:33.169 --> 28:34.421
Have a change of heart?

28:34.504 --> 28:37.298
I can't do this.
I can't live like this anymore.

28:38.007 --> 28:39.217
About the intel earlier.

28:39.718 --> 28:42.178
Could you bet your life on it?

28:42.262 --> 28:43.847
Yes, I told you.

28:44.347 --> 28:46.057
Wait, did you get some seed money?

28:46.558 --> 28:47.726
- I'm going to.
- Really?

28:47.809 --> 28:49.853
How are you… Hey, wait…

28:49.936 --> 28:52.188
SINSEGYE REAL ESTATE

28:52.272 --> 28:55.900
Sir, I'm not looking for a tenant anymore.
I'll just sell it urgently.

28:55.984 --> 28:57.902
All sales are urgent these days.

28:57.986 --> 28:58.820
Your price?

29:00.113 --> 29:01.239
How about 850 million?

29:03.283 --> 29:05.201
I could probably look into it.

29:06.035 --> 29:06.870
Take a seat.

29:06.953 --> 29:07.787
But

29:08.455 --> 29:11.082
I want the contract signed
and the down payment paid today.

29:11.166 --> 29:13.460
Do you know what time it is right now?

29:13.543 --> 29:16.045
You can't get a contract signed today.

29:16.129 --> 29:18.840
It's today or never.
I won't sell tomorrow.

29:21.176 --> 29:22.469
Are they seizing your place?

29:22.552 --> 29:24.929
Sir, can you make it happen or not?

29:32.771 --> 29:34.397
NOH WOO-SUNG
PREVIOUS ADDRESSES

29:34.481 --> 29:36.316
SINMYEONG BUDGET ROOM
CHEONGA BUDGET ROOM

29:44.491 --> 29:46.618
ELITE TOWN
SEMI-BASEMENT UNIT 101

29:48.703 --> 29:50.038
Oh, come on!

29:51.581 --> 29:53.666
ROYAL CITY SILEO
BUILDING 118, APARTMENT 1401

30:00.882 --> 30:03.134
PROPERTY REGISTRATION NOTICE

30:10.183 --> 30:12.018
SINSEGYE REAL ESTATE

30:12.101 --> 30:12.936
800 million?

30:13.019 --> 30:14.229
PURCHASE PRICE
800 MILLION WON

30:14.312 --> 30:17.398
What do you mean, 800 million won?

30:17.482 --> 30:20.151
You wouldn't get as much
if it went to auction.

30:22.570 --> 30:23.738
If you're not interested…

30:23.822 --> 30:25.907
Wait. Please wait…

30:26.491 --> 30:29.577
But I still want 85 million
as a down payment.

30:30.078 --> 30:32.789
Hey, you're a lucky man.
All in a matter of hours.

30:32.872 --> 30:34.290
Check the details.

30:34.791 --> 30:36.751
GA JU-HO ON BEHALF OF GA JUN-CHEOL

30:39.379 --> 30:41.673
Hold on. The purchaser details seem off.

30:41.756 --> 30:42.799
Born in 2009?

30:43.383 --> 30:44.759
Is this for your son?

30:45.343 --> 30:47.637
He's in the States.
Should we fly him here?

30:48.263 --> 30:49.639
No. I'm just jealous.

30:50.139 --> 30:51.349
This guy…

30:51.933 --> 30:53.142
What happens…

30:54.769 --> 30:57.647
if the contract is canceled
before I receive the installment?

30:57.730 --> 31:00.525
No way. He'd never do that.

31:00.608 --> 31:02.819
That would be his loss.
He'd be down 85 million.

31:02.902 --> 31:04.487
No. What if I cancel it?

31:04.571 --> 31:08.366
Then it'd be a bigger loss for you.
You'd have to pay him double. 170 million.

31:08.449 --> 31:10.785
170 million. That's it, right?

31:10.869 --> 31:13.454
What do you mean "that's it"?
That's a lot of money.

31:16.040 --> 31:17.417
NOH WOO-SUNG

31:20.378 --> 31:22.130
APARTMENT DOWN PAYMENT
85 MILLION WON

31:40.023 --> 31:40.857
BATTERY 5%

32:21.356 --> 32:23.524
Hey, did you get the money?

32:24.025 --> 32:25.401
- Yeah.
- How much?

32:25.485 --> 32:26.653
Eighty-five million.

32:27.153 --> 32:28.404
- I sold my place.
- For real?

32:28.988 --> 32:31.991
- I'll get the money, then call it off.
- Dude, that's genius!

32:32.742 --> 32:35.703
Okay, listen up. A limit order
can backfire if they sell out.

32:35.787 --> 32:38.706
You have to purchase at market value
when it gets to 815 won.

32:38.790 --> 32:39.916
- Okay?
- 815.

32:40.541 --> 32:42.251
Just buy in at 815 won, right?

32:42.335 --> 32:44.462
Yes. I told you, it's 815! Liberation Day!

32:44.545 --> 32:46.464
- It's time. Focus and talk later.
- Yeah.

32:46.547 --> 32:47.924
- Bye!
- Holy shit.

33:32.635 --> 33:33.761
CONFIRM PURCHASE

33:37.932 --> 33:40.059
PURCHASE CONFIRMED
GB COIN

33:52.113 --> 33:52.947
Hey.

33:53.448 --> 33:54.574
Are you seeing this?

33:55.575 --> 33:57.243
- Hey.
- Yeah.

33:58.411 --> 34:00.413
What the fuck is going on here?

34:00.496 --> 34:01.581
I know.

34:01.664 --> 34:03.041
I think it has doubled.

34:03.124 --> 34:04.459
Chang-wu, is this right?

34:04.542 --> 34:05.543
- Right?
- Right?

34:05.626 --> 34:08.254
- Right?
- Dude, is this… Is this okay?

34:08.337 --> 34:10.882
- It's still rising.
- Dude, shut up.

34:10.965 --> 34:13.968
We can't let our guard down
before we cash out, okay?

34:14.052 --> 34:16.179
When did I say it would peak?
Read it to me.

34:16.262 --> 34:17.472
Right, okay.

34:17.972 --> 34:21.392
- August 15.
- Yeah, on August 15.

34:21.476 --> 34:25.521
- At 8:15 in the morning.
- 8:15 a.m.

34:25.605 --> 34:27.982
- Peak return, 815%.
- Exactly.

34:28.066 --> 34:30.068
- Right?
- You just need to remember "815."

34:30.151 --> 34:34.238
It'll get dumped right after 8:15,
so we'll just dump it before then.

34:34.322 --> 34:36.491
- Let's not get greedy.
- Yes, okay.

34:36.574 --> 34:38.284
- Hey.
- What is it?

34:38.367 --> 34:40.620
So, maybe at around…

34:40.703 --> 34:42.121
Around 800…

34:45.124 --> 34:46.334
Come on, what is it?

34:46.417 --> 34:49.712
We could sell at around 800%, right?

34:49.796 --> 34:51.005
Heck yeah.

34:51.089 --> 34:54.300
Hey, we should sell right away
if something doesn't seem right.

34:54.383 --> 34:57.303
Let's just take time off
and stay at home until Liberation Day.

34:57.386 --> 34:59.138
Have our eyes glued to it all day.

34:59.222 --> 35:00.306
Hey, Chang-wu.

35:00.389 --> 35:03.476
- What is it now?
- Thanks, you know.

35:03.559 --> 35:06.604
You can thank me in your debt-free future.

35:06.687 --> 35:07.563
Okay!

36:30.521 --> 36:32.857
TOTAL PROFIT +137,333,799 KRW
TOTAL ROR +161.65%

37:22.406 --> 37:23.699
8:15 A.M., AUGUST 15
ROR 815%

37:54.939 --> 37:56.190
YOU'RE TOO LOUD
BE QUIET!

37:57.358 --> 37:58.442
I'm sorry about this,

37:59.318 --> 38:00.569
but can I check inside?

38:01.195 --> 38:03.322
Are you blaming me
for the noise right now?

38:03.906 --> 38:05.908
If you don't like it, let me see inside.

38:07.576 --> 38:09.036
Fine. Let's take a look.

38:12.790 --> 38:15.209
You've got to be kidding me.

38:15.293 --> 38:17.044
This is driving me nuts.

38:17.128 --> 38:19.880
Why does it get quiet
whenever someone comes over?

38:20.464 --> 38:22.133
Is this really a coincidence?

38:22.216 --> 38:23.467
I know, right?

38:23.551 --> 38:26.637
It's driving me insane too.
It's as if someone's watching me.

38:27.346 --> 38:28.389
Who would be watching?

38:28.472 --> 38:29.640
I think…

38:31.600 --> 38:32.727
it's the people below.

38:34.061 --> 38:35.354
- Below?
- Yes.

38:36.689 --> 38:38.190
You'll know when you see them,

38:38.274 --> 38:40.985
but I don't think
they're in their right minds.

38:41.068 --> 38:45.072
I think they're trying to get back at me.
Should we go see them together?

38:45.656 --> 38:48.451
So the sound from downstairs
is reaching my place?

38:48.534 --> 38:51.412
You probably don't know,
but this building…

38:51.954 --> 38:54.040
See this? It's a load-bearing system.

38:54.123 --> 38:56.000
All the walls are connected as one--

38:56.083 --> 38:57.126
You shitting me?

38:58.252 --> 38:59.128
Sorry?

39:01.672 --> 39:02.882
I'm done with this.

39:04.550 --> 39:06.469
You can't beat someone
who lives above you.

39:19.815 --> 39:21.233
What the hell?

39:21.859 --> 39:23.486
Seriously? Are you kidding?

39:24.070 --> 39:25.613
Are you kidding me?

39:39.668 --> 39:40.795
PLEASE BE QUIET!

39:40.878 --> 39:43.381
Hey! I know you're in there. Come out!

39:43.464 --> 39:45.508
I said get out here!

39:45.591 --> 39:47.259
What are you doing?

39:49.220 --> 39:50.513
I live upstairs.

39:51.013 --> 39:52.556
These people are spying on me.

39:52.640 --> 39:55.684
They're watching me
to know when to make noise.

39:55.768 --> 39:57.978
I heard it was you
who was making the noise.

39:58.771 --> 40:00.231
Me? You think it's me?

40:00.314 --> 40:02.066
Says who? The people in 1301?

40:02.149 --> 40:03.442
Excuse me. Wait…

40:03.526 --> 40:04.693
Come on, hear me out.

40:04.777 --> 40:06.278
It's really not me.

40:06.362 --> 40:07.530
Hello?

40:19.166 --> 40:20.876
Mind if I borrow your lighter?

40:21.460 --> 40:22.420
Sure.

40:30.428 --> 40:31.846
What are you looking at?

40:32.847 --> 40:34.348
Oh, it's nothing.

40:35.599 --> 40:38.602
Did you know there was a murder
in the next complex over?

40:39.478 --> 40:41.272
Really? Why?

40:45.276 --> 40:46.986
Noise complaints, apparently.

40:51.490 --> 40:53.451
That's no excuse to kill someone.

40:54.827 --> 40:57.288
Our building has
serious noise complaints too.

40:57.371 --> 40:58.873
It's really concerning.

41:00.541 --> 41:01.792
It's not that bad.

41:03.294 --> 41:05.671
That's what
a noise-making prick would say.

41:07.923 --> 41:08.757
Sorry?

41:12.386 --> 41:14.263
If we do end up with a murder,

41:14.889 --> 41:17.433
the property value would plummet,
wouldn't it?

41:19.727 --> 41:21.187
What the hell are you saying?

42:47.856 --> 42:49.024
You fucking dickhead!

42:49.733 --> 42:53.237
It was you! You slashed my tire
with that knife, you piece of shit!

42:53.320 --> 42:56.699
That's how you wanna play?
Well, I'm not going anywhere!

43:07.334 --> 43:09.044
LIBERATION DAY D-6

43:24.184 --> 43:26.353
Let's go!

43:26.437 --> 43:27.938
LIBERATION DAY D-4

43:35.487 --> 43:36.614
Damn it!

43:36.697 --> 43:37.865
LIBERATION DAY D-3

43:47.916 --> 43:49.084
LIBERATION DAY D-2

43:52.504 --> 43:53.464
Open up!

43:54.882 --> 43:57.134
- Come out!
- Get out here!

43:57.217 --> 43:58.969
- Is he even home?
- What's he doing?

44:18.072 --> 44:20.032
I'm actually in Seoul. At my son's place.

44:20.115 --> 44:23.077
Hey, it's time for breakfast.
Let's talk later.

44:26.246 --> 44:27.081
Mom?

44:27.831 --> 44:29.958
Oh, you're awake.

44:30.584 --> 44:32.002
Come on, let's eat.

44:33.337 --> 44:34.713
Have things been tough?

44:37.549 --> 44:38.801
Yeah, of course.

44:39.677 --> 44:40.594
I'm sorry

44:41.679 --> 44:44.348
that I'm not from Seoul.

44:44.848 --> 44:45.849
But Mom.

44:48.894 --> 44:50.229
Everything's fine now.

44:51.647 --> 44:54.441
I took care of all my debt
and your loans too.

44:54.525 --> 44:55.526
Shut it.

44:55.609 --> 44:56.443
What?

44:56.527 --> 45:00.364
It's too damn loud!

45:42.322 --> 45:43.907
Fuck me.

45:45.743 --> 45:46.827
LIBERATION DAY D-1

45:50.664 --> 45:53.959
TOTAL PROFIT +407,779,009 KRW
TOTAL ROR +479.98%

46:46.762 --> 46:47.846
Fuck.

46:57.731 --> 46:58.941
These motherfuckers.

46:59.024 --> 47:00.442
All right, let's play.

47:00.526 --> 47:02.778
Let's do this. Let's go.

47:10.077 --> 47:11.495
- Open the door!
- What?

47:12.496 --> 47:14.331
- Open up.
- I'm telling you, it's not me!

47:14.414 --> 47:16.083
Just get out here for a moment!

47:16.875 --> 47:18.627
Just open your door already!

47:18.710 --> 47:20.879
Why the fuck are you all giving me shit…

47:24.216 --> 47:27.010
- He's scary.
- He was home all this time.

47:27.845 --> 47:28.679
It stopped.

47:28.762 --> 47:31.265
- He has some nerve.
- The subwoofer sound stopped!

47:32.015 --> 47:32.850
It did.

47:34.309 --> 47:37.604
You were trying to blame me
for being too noisy, but it was you?

47:37.688 --> 47:41.525
- You bitched to me about the sound.
- See that? It's this guy, for sure.

47:41.608 --> 47:43.402
Everyone, let's not talk out here.

47:43.485 --> 47:45.863
Let's check inside
while we're all here, yes?

47:45.946 --> 47:47.406
- Yes, let's!
- Let's check it out.

47:47.489 --> 47:49.408
Hold on a sec. I said hold on!

47:49.491 --> 47:51.994
Look, I know this looks bad!

47:52.077 --> 47:52.953
I'll just check.

47:53.036 --> 47:54.621
- Check!
- You're not coming inside!

47:55.497 --> 47:56.582
Isn't this trespassing?

47:56.665 --> 47:59.293
It's not just any noise.
It sounds like a subwoofer.

47:59.376 --> 48:02.212
- What do you mean "a subwoofer"?
- Let's not do this here.

48:02.296 --> 48:03.672
Let's just call the police.

48:03.755 --> 48:05.465
- Yes, call the police!
- Call them!

48:05.549 --> 48:06.550
Put him behind bars!

48:06.633 --> 48:08.176
Stop this at once!

48:09.511 --> 48:11.805
- You're all giving me a headache.
- Who's that?

48:12.472 --> 48:14.975
Why are you all so desperate
to blow this up?

48:15.475 --> 48:17.728
You all know it's a crucial time
for our complex.

48:17.811 --> 48:20.939
We know that, but we can't live like this.

48:21.023 --> 48:23.650
We can't live at all
if the property value goes down.

48:23.734 --> 48:26.153
Would you burn a house down
to catch a bedbug?

48:27.321 --> 48:30.365
Why would catching one noisy jerk
be a problem for the complex?

48:30.949 --> 48:32.784
Kind of sounds like a leap.

48:38.081 --> 48:38.957
What?

48:39.458 --> 48:43.128
Were you going to send this
to a TV network or post it online?

48:44.254 --> 48:48.175
You must be itching to tell everyone
our complex has a noise issue.

48:48.675 --> 48:50.594
I've been thinking about it,

48:50.677 --> 48:52.763
and it just doesn't make sense.

48:53.639 --> 48:56.683
If you can't deal with the noise,
you should leave.

48:56.767 --> 48:59.144
Why do you insist on living here?

48:59.227 --> 49:02.940
Are you saying
that this man is making noise

49:03.023 --> 49:05.150
to keep renters from living here?

49:05.233 --> 49:06.068
That must be it.

49:06.151 --> 49:08.820
Once the GTX comes through,
the rent is bound to go up.

49:08.904 --> 49:11.114
He must've been faking a noise issue.

49:11.198 --> 49:12.574
Hold on.

49:13.075 --> 49:14.326
This is getting weird.

49:14.409 --> 49:16.036
What kind of logic is that?

49:16.703 --> 49:18.330
Wait a minute.

49:19.039 --> 49:21.124
Are you falsely accusing us
because we rent?

49:21.208 --> 49:22.793
"Falsely accusing," my ass.

49:24.336 --> 49:27.381
Hey, upstairs guy. It suddenly went quiet
when you came down, right?

49:27.464 --> 49:28.715
You know why that is?

49:30.467 --> 49:33.011
The folks downstairs
were watching me through a camera!

49:33.095 --> 49:37.015
They only made noise when I was home
and fell silent if anyone came over.

49:37.641 --> 49:39.726
- To pin it all on me.
- You got evidence?

49:39.810 --> 49:41.895
Evidence? Show us your phone.

49:42.396 --> 49:45.857
Everyone, I'm sure it's them.
We should check their place first.

49:45.941 --> 49:48.110
We'll definitely find speakers
at their place.

49:48.193 --> 49:49.277
Just a moment.

49:49.361 --> 49:50.862
All right, Woo-sung.

49:51.363 --> 49:54.783
You'll let us see your apartment
if we check downstairs first, right?

49:54.866 --> 49:55.701
Yes!

49:57.077 --> 49:58.286
Of course. For sure.

49:59.371 --> 50:00.706
But it won't come to that.

50:01.289 --> 50:03.583
Then, let's take a look
at your place first.

50:03.667 --> 50:06.169
Everyone's here already.
Let's check here first.

50:06.253 --> 50:08.714
Why? So you can clean up yours
while they check mine?

50:08.797 --> 50:10.507
No. I'm going to stay right here.

50:10.590 --> 50:11.633
Woo-sung.

50:11.717 --> 50:13.260
- You're not the culprit.
- I'm not.

50:13.343 --> 50:16.179
Let's just see yours first.
We'll get nowhere by arguing.

50:21.059 --> 50:22.853
All right, ma'am. Let's do that.

50:25.731 --> 50:27.274
We'll have the super enter.

50:27.357 --> 50:28.275
Yes, ma'am.

50:28.358 --> 50:29.860
I'm going in with him.

50:30.360 --> 50:32.320
We all have the same floor plan anyway.

50:32.404 --> 50:33.947
We should take a proper look.

50:34.031 --> 50:36.241
It would be faster with two people.
Go ahead.

50:38.994 --> 50:39.911
Look, mister.

50:40.787 --> 50:42.289
I'll be searching your home.

50:42.873 --> 50:43.790
If you say so.

50:46.043 --> 50:48.378
- Where's it coming from now?
- Do you hear that?

50:48.462 --> 50:49.546
Do you all hear that?

50:49.629 --> 50:52.215
Still think it's me? Well, do you?

50:52.299 --> 50:54.342
Okay, let's head downstairs now.

50:54.426 --> 50:55.719
Let's go!

50:55.802 --> 50:56.887
I found it.

51:01.475 --> 51:03.977
That looks like
an inter-floor revenge speaker.

51:23.413 --> 51:26.208
18 HOURS OF CONSTRUCTION NOISE

51:26.958 --> 51:29.461
So it's the people downstairs, is it?

51:31.880 --> 51:32.964
This…

51:34.216 --> 51:36.468
You absolute piece of shit.

51:42.516 --> 51:44.601
What the hell did you do? What did you do?

51:45.102 --> 51:46.394
How did you pull this crap?

51:48.647 --> 51:51.858
You should visit a loony bin
before the police station.

51:52.359 --> 51:55.737
When did you fucking do this?
When did you come into my apartment?

51:55.821 --> 51:57.280
What do you think you're doing?

51:57.364 --> 51:59.449
When the hell
did you get into my apartment?

51:59.533 --> 52:01.326
Get out!

52:01.409 --> 52:04.830
Everyone out! Get out!
Get the hell out of my home!

52:04.913 --> 52:06.790
What on earth is going on in there?

52:08.458 --> 52:09.334
It wasn't me.

52:09.417 --> 52:12.379
This asshole must have climbed
over my balcony to set this up.

52:12.462 --> 52:13.505
It was all--

52:15.924 --> 52:16.925
Oh my God.

52:46.955 --> 52:48.373
- Hey.
- He hit him, didn't he?

52:49.791 --> 52:51.042
Is he dead?

52:51.126 --> 52:52.794
I didn't touch him…

52:52.878 --> 52:55.255
- Excuse us. Coming through.
- We received a call.

52:55.338 --> 52:56.798
- He hit that guy.
- Excuse me.

52:58.925 --> 53:00.051
Hands up.

53:00.135 --> 53:02.512
Back away. Back away now!

53:02.596 --> 53:04.306
But I just…

53:04.389 --> 53:06.516
- On your knees. Don't move.
- Honey!

53:06.600 --> 53:07.851
- On your knees.
- He hit you?

53:07.934 --> 53:10.520
- You're under arrest for battery.
- That asshole hit him!

53:11.563 --> 53:14.191
Come on, how many times
do I have to tell you?

53:14.274 --> 53:15.942
I'm the one who was hit.

53:16.026 --> 53:17.944
The downstairs guy hurt himself!

53:18.028 --> 53:19.654
All right. Just wait a minute.

53:19.738 --> 53:21.239
The victim will be here soon.

53:21.323 --> 53:23.366
Dump at 8:15!

53:23.950 --> 53:25.410
This is insane.

53:25.493 --> 53:26.870
I'm the victim here!

53:28.538 --> 53:30.957
Excuse me, officer, sir!

53:31.041 --> 53:33.668
I really can't be here
like this right now.

53:33.752 --> 53:35.670
There's something my life depends on.

53:35.754 --> 53:38.882
I'll go home real quick, then come back
and put these back on. Please?

53:39.382 --> 53:40.425
What do you need to do?

53:40.508 --> 53:42.135
It's a personal matter.

53:43.720 --> 53:45.555
- I see. Personal?
- Yes.

53:46.431 --> 53:48.558
Why don't we take care
of public matter first?

53:48.642 --> 53:50.060
I want my cell phone!

53:50.143 --> 53:52.395
I'll call my lawyer. Give me my phone!

53:54.898 --> 53:56.358
Which of these two is it?

53:56.441 --> 53:57.609
It's the…

53:57.692 --> 53:59.945
The black one. That's it.

54:01.071 --> 54:03.615
Why does he have two cell phones?

54:04.157 --> 54:07.327
The other one was connected
to the inter-floor speaker.

54:07.410 --> 54:08.620
Is that so?

54:15.001 --> 54:16.294
Can I use the bathroom?

54:16.378 --> 54:18.588
- Right now?
- Should I just go here?

54:18.672 --> 54:20.507
Hey, just wait.

54:21.633 --> 54:23.426
- Strange.
- It's suddenly killing me.

54:25.220 --> 54:26.888
Hey, get him!

54:28.640 --> 54:30.141
Just a moment!

54:31.017 --> 54:33.520
- Relax and do not resist!
- Please.

54:33.603 --> 54:35.438
- Don't move!
- Just let go of me.

54:35.522 --> 54:36.856
What's with all the noise?

54:36.940 --> 54:40.610
I was finally getting to my paperwork.
I'm writing reports in here!

54:40.694 --> 54:42.737
The suspect was trying to escape.

54:42.821 --> 54:44.364
I apologize, sir.

54:48.576 --> 54:51.079
Hey, what the hell is that idiot doing?

54:51.997 --> 54:53.164
He just ran for it!

54:56.251 --> 54:57.377
QR CODE LOG IN

54:57.460 --> 54:58.837
QR IDENTITY VERIFICATION

54:59.921 --> 55:01.589
The key. Bring me the key!

55:01.673 --> 55:02.799
For fuck's sake.

55:02.882 --> 55:05.385
That's my personal office, you prick!

55:05.885 --> 55:07.887
Come out before we break this door down!

55:16.771 --> 55:19.232
Come on.

55:19.316 --> 55:20.442
Come on, please.

55:27.782 --> 55:28.616
Come out!

55:29.200 --> 55:31.494
- I have the keys!
- Hurry and open it.

55:31.578 --> 55:32.412
Open it.

55:33.163 --> 55:33.997
MARKET ORDER

55:38.418 --> 55:40.587
CONFIRM SALE

55:43.256 --> 55:45.175
Just a little more.

55:46.051 --> 55:46.885
It's open!

55:46.968 --> 55:47.802
Hey, push!

55:47.886 --> 55:49.346
Just a moment!

55:49.429 --> 55:50.513
The couch is there.

55:51.264 --> 55:52.724
Sir, just ten more seconds.

55:52.807 --> 55:54.225
Ten seconds, my ass!

55:54.309 --> 55:56.227
Shoot. Just shoot him!

55:56.311 --> 55:58.521
Hey, don't aim at his face though!

56:01.941 --> 56:03.068
I got him!

56:05.737 --> 56:07.572
- Just keep pushing!
- Push!

56:15.163 --> 56:16.331
Freeze!

56:16.414 --> 56:17.290
Hands in the air!

56:17.374 --> 56:19.209
What are you doing with my computer?

56:27.926 --> 56:30.095
What the…
He shouldn't be tanking the Taser.

56:30.178 --> 56:31.096
Hello?

56:33.556 --> 56:35.100
Hey, what's wrong with him?

56:36.101 --> 56:37.602
He's moving!

56:49.697 --> 56:51.032
CONFIRM SALE

56:53.785 --> 56:55.245
CONFIRM SALE

57:05.505 --> 57:08.091
You still shouldn't have tased him.

57:08.174 --> 57:09.968
That's excessive use of force.

57:10.051 --> 57:12.887
Please help us gloss over this
without too much trouble.

57:13.888 --> 57:15.014
Are you okay?

57:15.765 --> 57:16.766
Are you okay?

57:17.934 --> 57:20.937
We confirmed the illegal spy cam
on Jeon Gwang-cheol's phone.

57:21.020 --> 57:24.941
And your representative has testified
that your neighbor initiated the violence.

57:25.024 --> 57:27.819
- I apologize for the misunderstanding.
- He's apologizing.

57:27.902 --> 57:30.363
You'll accept his apology,
won't you, Woo-sung?

57:31.281 --> 57:33.867
- I guess we can wrap this up, then.
- Sounds good.

57:34.868 --> 57:35.910
I know it seems unfair,

57:35.994 --> 57:39.122
but it's best to just move on,
given the circumstances.

57:39.747 --> 57:42.667
You may go home now.
And take your phone with you.

57:47.005 --> 57:47.964
Take it in this.

57:50.758 --> 57:53.928
AUGUST 15
12:15

58:02.979 --> 58:04.981
Our house prices will rise now!

58:05.064 --> 58:07.066
CONGRATULATIONS
GTX-K LINE NOGANG STATION CONFIRMED

58:07.150 --> 58:08.485
We waited for so long!

58:37.722 --> 58:39.641
TOTAL PROFIT -84,940,508 KRW
TOTAL ROR -99.98%

59:52.088 --> 59:53.715
I HAVE LOST EVERYTHING

59:53.798 --> 59:55.216
I TRIED TO HOLD ON

59:55.300 --> 59:58.261
BUT I GUESS I GOT TOO GREEDY

01:00:00.346 --> 01:00:04.684
I'M SORRY, MOM
THIS IS ALL JUST SO UNFAIR

01:01:00.907 --> 01:01:03.326
Hey, I told you to keep it down.

01:01:06.496 --> 01:01:08.414
I told you it's not me.

01:01:08.498 --> 01:01:10.208
It really isn't me.

01:01:11.000 --> 01:01:12.460
You son of a bitch!

01:01:15.004 --> 01:01:17.674
It's not me. It's not…

01:01:22.011 --> 01:01:24.222
- Help me! Help--
- Help you?

01:01:24.305 --> 01:01:26.099
For fuck's sake!

01:01:26.182 --> 01:01:28.017
- Help you?
- Someone, help!

01:01:28.643 --> 01:01:30.853
Let's put an end to this today,

01:01:30.937 --> 01:01:32.271
you piece of shit!

01:01:46.661 --> 01:01:48.830
What the hell? It really wasn't you?

01:01:48.913 --> 01:01:52.125
I told you it wasn't me, you fucker!

01:02:08.099 --> 01:02:10.560
I get that life isn't fair
to you right now,

01:02:11.894 --> 01:02:13.771
but how would your mom survive this?

01:02:14.355 --> 01:02:15.690
I'm done for.

01:02:17.525 --> 01:02:19.360
All because of those pricks downstairs.

01:02:20.695 --> 01:02:22.029
My life has gone to shit.

01:02:22.655 --> 01:02:23.573
So what?

01:02:24.073 --> 01:02:26.659
Were you going to kill
the people downstairs with this?

01:02:26.743 --> 01:02:29.912
Just listen to that.
They're still making noise.

01:02:30.413 --> 01:02:31.247
Exactly.

01:02:32.540 --> 01:02:34.250
Why are they so damn persistent?

01:02:34.333 --> 01:02:36.043
There must be a reason.

01:02:36.919 --> 01:02:38.004
I guess so.

01:02:38.588 --> 01:02:40.047
Let's pay them a visit.

01:02:40.590 --> 01:02:42.884
- We'll go together.
- Together?

01:02:42.967 --> 01:02:45.011
Why, all of a sudden?

01:02:45.094 --> 01:02:47.013
You used to treat me like the bad guy.

01:02:48.598 --> 01:02:49.724
Let's go and see.

01:03:26.719 --> 01:03:27.762
Anyone home?

01:03:28.679 --> 01:03:30.264
Is anybody in?

01:03:31.265 --> 01:03:32.975
Oh, look. The door is unlocked.

01:03:33.935 --> 01:03:35.603
You wouldn't want to get burgled.

01:03:46.030 --> 01:03:47.448
I don't think anyone's home.

01:03:47.990 --> 01:03:51.702
They could come back any minute.
Look for anything big. Like speakers.

01:03:51.786 --> 01:03:52.620
Get on it.

01:03:53.120 --> 01:03:54.038
Something big.

01:04:17.687 --> 01:04:18.938
I don't see anything.

01:04:19.772 --> 01:04:22.024
Wait, why is the noise still going?

01:04:23.276 --> 01:04:24.861
I guess it's not these guys.

01:04:25.361 --> 01:04:27.446
Someone else must be making the noise.

01:04:31.367 --> 01:04:33.411
Look at all these overdue bills.

01:04:33.494 --> 01:04:35.705
Look. Loans and taxes.

01:04:37.331 --> 01:04:38.374
ENFORCEMENT NOTICE

01:04:38.457 --> 01:04:39.625
Holy shit.

01:04:40.334 --> 01:04:42.420
How was the landlord born in '09?

01:04:43.296 --> 01:04:44.380
Look here.

01:04:44.463 --> 01:04:46.048
LONG-TERM LEASE EXTENSION CONTRACT

01:04:49.802 --> 01:04:51.888
It's him, Ga Jun-cheol. Born in '09.

01:04:52.388 --> 01:04:54.056
The penthouse neighbors
bought my place too.

01:04:54.140 --> 01:04:55.975
You know what the scariest part is?

01:04:56.517 --> 01:04:58.019
They're my landlords too.

01:04:58.102 --> 01:05:00.897
- Really?
- They leveraged my deposit to buy my unit.

01:05:02.273 --> 01:05:05.192
So they own
the 13th, 14th, and 15th floors?

01:05:05.276 --> 01:05:06.611
Maybe more, for all we know.

01:05:07.236 --> 01:05:09.864
What, are they trying
to buy the entire building?

01:05:11.741 --> 01:05:13.117
I can't stand them.

01:05:13.701 --> 01:05:15.286
They must have known about the GTX.

01:05:15.369 --> 01:05:17.914
They're making all these noises

01:05:17.997 --> 01:05:19.874
so they can buy the whole place up.

01:05:19.957 --> 01:05:21.417
But it just doesn't add up.

01:05:21.500 --> 01:05:24.003
With so many units,
a noise issue would only harm them.

01:05:24.086 --> 01:05:27.006
Everyone kept quiet last night
to protect property values, right?

01:05:28.507 --> 01:05:29.759
We're onto something.

01:05:30.259 --> 01:05:31.719
It's the penthouse people, isn't it?

01:05:31.802 --> 01:05:36.223
If they're really behind it,
wouldn't all these contracts be void?

01:05:37.683 --> 01:05:38.601
What do you mean?

01:05:38.684 --> 01:05:40.227
If we find solid evidence

01:05:40.311 --> 01:05:43.648
and tell them we'll make it public
if they don't annul the contracts,

01:05:43.731 --> 01:05:45.691
what the fuck could they do then?

01:05:46.817 --> 01:05:49.987
These kinds of people
don't like to escalate things.

01:05:50.071 --> 01:05:51.948
Okay.

01:05:52.823 --> 01:05:53.824
You're right.

01:05:54.325 --> 01:05:55.952
So we just need to find proof?

01:05:56.535 --> 01:05:57.703
Proof?

01:05:57.787 --> 01:05:59.622
We'd need to at least find speakers.

01:06:00.206 --> 01:06:01.916
We can't exactly search their place.

01:06:06.087 --> 01:06:09.048
PENTHOUSE

01:06:19.725 --> 01:06:20.559
Hello?

01:06:20.643 --> 01:06:22.269
So you're awake.

01:06:22.353 --> 01:06:24.105
I hope I didn't wake you.

01:06:24.188 --> 01:06:26.107
What can I do for you?

01:06:26.190 --> 01:06:28.734
I'd like to talk about
what happened yesterday.

01:06:28.818 --> 01:06:30.236
Can you come up briefly?

01:06:31.237 --> 01:06:32.154
Right now?

01:06:32.738 --> 01:06:34.198
It will only take a moment.

01:06:34.865 --> 01:06:36.826
Yes, well… All right, then.

01:06:44.917 --> 01:06:46.252
Could you help me out?

01:06:58.139 --> 01:06:59.724
Are you feeling better?

01:07:00.641 --> 01:07:01.642
Yes, well…

01:07:02.351 --> 01:07:03.686
What's this about?

01:07:06.856 --> 01:07:08.774
It's about what happened yesterday.

01:07:10.401 --> 01:07:13.279
Are you sure
the downstairs neighbor hurt himself?

01:07:15.531 --> 01:07:16.615
We've been over that.

01:07:19.785 --> 01:07:21.704
You can be honest with me.

01:07:24.040 --> 01:07:24.999
I'll help you.

01:07:26.417 --> 01:07:27.918
What's this all about?

01:07:28.002 --> 01:07:28.878
The thing is,

01:07:28.961 --> 01:07:31.213
I want to keep this from escalating,

01:07:31.881 --> 01:07:33.758
but the state he's in…

01:07:36.844 --> 01:07:37.720
One moment.

01:07:43.476 --> 01:07:44.518
Who is it?

01:07:44.602 --> 01:07:48.314
Hello. I'm the tenant in 1501.

01:07:48.981 --> 01:07:50.316
Do you remember me?

01:07:50.399 --> 01:07:51.400
I do. And?

01:07:51.484 --> 01:07:52.526
The thing is…

01:07:53.235 --> 01:07:55.446
- There's an issue with my place.
- Excuse me.

01:07:56.030 --> 01:07:58.949
- Can I use your bathroom?
- Do you have some time to talk?

01:07:59.033 --> 01:08:01.077
- That way.
- It will only take a moment.

01:09:06.350 --> 01:09:07.560
You're my landlord, so--

01:09:07.643 --> 01:09:09.895
- Hey, wait!
- Get out, you bastard!

01:09:10.813 --> 01:09:12.898
The bathroom.
I was looking for the bathroom!

01:09:12.982 --> 01:09:14.191
What's going on?

01:09:14.692 --> 01:09:17.069
This asshole was going through our room.

01:09:17.153 --> 01:09:18.237
Fucking thief.

01:09:18.988 --> 01:09:20.990
- Who are you calling a thief?
- Let go!

01:09:21.073 --> 01:09:23.325
You knew the GTX
would come in, didn't you?

01:09:23.409 --> 01:09:26.579
You made all that noise
so you could buy my apartment for cheap!

01:09:27.079 --> 01:09:28.080
What are you on about?

01:09:28.164 --> 01:09:31.167
You think we'd pull that crap
over some chump change?

01:09:31.250 --> 01:09:33.085
Chump change?

01:09:33.711 --> 01:09:35.004
Then cancel the contract.

01:09:35.087 --> 01:09:37.798
I'll go to TV stations
or file a public complaint.

01:09:40.676 --> 01:09:41.594
What?

01:09:42.219 --> 01:09:44.680
I… I'm dead serious.

01:09:54.440 --> 01:09:57.109
Let's talk another time.
Would you get rid of that guy?

01:09:57.193 --> 01:09:58.527
Get rid of me?

01:09:58.611 --> 01:10:00.154
- That's enough.
- You think I won't?

01:10:00.237 --> 01:10:02.615
- I'm going to fucking bust you!
- Hey, come on.

01:10:02.698 --> 01:10:05.242
- I'll find all the evidence here!
- Come on already!

01:10:07.745 --> 01:10:10.789
You should have backed off
and then gone back to look again,

01:10:10.873 --> 01:10:12.458
not throw yourself at them.

01:10:12.958 --> 01:10:15.336
I'm certain. It's the penthouse people.

01:10:15.920 --> 01:10:16.921
Did you see something?

01:10:17.838 --> 01:10:20.341
There was a steel door
with a fingerprint scanner.

01:10:20.424 --> 01:10:23.761
Who has something like that?
That's where they're making the noise.

01:10:23.844 --> 01:10:25.888
A steel door with a fingerprint scanner?

01:10:25.971 --> 01:10:28.057
- Yes.
- That does seem shady.

01:10:28.766 --> 01:10:30.392
I'll get the fuck in there and--

01:10:30.476 --> 01:10:32.561
Okay, I get it. Stop getting so worked up.

01:10:34.063 --> 01:10:36.440
Let's calm down
and come up with a plan together.

01:10:37.566 --> 01:10:38.400
Together?

01:10:39.652 --> 01:10:40.945
I feel bad for accusing you.

01:10:42.321 --> 01:10:44.406
I'd… appreciate that.

01:10:44.490 --> 01:10:47.493
So we wasted a shit ton of time
fighting each other

01:10:47.576 --> 01:10:49.161
when it was some other jerks.

01:10:49.245 --> 01:10:50.621
Exactly.

01:10:52.206 --> 01:10:53.040
Right.

01:10:53.958 --> 01:10:56.126
My name is Noh Woo-sung.

01:10:57.419 --> 01:10:58.796
I'm Yeong Jin-ho.

01:10:59.338 --> 01:11:01.715
Good to meet you, Jin-ho.
You can call me Woo-sung.

01:11:02.216 --> 01:11:04.051
I was gonna do that anyway.

01:11:05.511 --> 01:11:08.264
Let's clean up
and get some rest for now, yeah?

01:11:08.347 --> 01:11:10.307
We need rest to reclaim your apartment.

01:11:10.975 --> 01:11:11.809
Right.

01:11:30.995 --> 01:11:32.663
FRIDAY, AUGUST 16

01:11:32.746 --> 01:11:34.081
DRAW YOUR UNLOCK PATTERN

01:11:45.676 --> 01:11:47.678
Jin-ho. It's me, Woo-sung.

01:11:55.728 --> 01:11:57.604
Hey. Already had enough sleep?

01:11:58.522 --> 01:12:00.482
My Wi-Fi at home got cut.

01:12:00.983 --> 01:12:02.901
Would you mind if I used yours?

01:12:03.652 --> 01:12:05.487
Wi-Fi? I don't have any.

01:12:06.905 --> 01:12:08.532
Oh, you don't?

01:12:09.074 --> 01:12:11.201
All right, then.
You should get some sleep.

01:12:15.164 --> 01:12:16.123
Woo-sung.

01:12:18.334 --> 01:12:19.418
Yes?

01:12:19.501 --> 01:12:21.211
I'm going to the sauna. Want to come?

01:12:21.295 --> 01:12:23.339
Sweating it out is great for sleep.

01:12:23.839 --> 01:12:25.966
I actually just showered.

01:12:26.050 --> 01:12:27.968
I'm going to sleep. Rest up, Jin-ho.

01:13:21.939 --> 01:13:23.399
Welcome.

01:13:28.987 --> 01:13:29.947
Jin-ho!

01:13:31.490 --> 01:13:32.866
I thought you were resting.

01:13:33.492 --> 01:13:34.827
I couldn't sleep.

01:13:34.910 --> 01:13:36.745
Yeah, you need to sweat it all out.

01:13:36.829 --> 01:13:37.830
Right.

01:13:40.958 --> 01:13:44.211
Man, I forgot I can't get in
because I skipped the maintenance fee.

01:13:44.878 --> 01:13:46.755
- You go on.
- He can use my account, right?

01:13:47.631 --> 01:13:49.425
We don't normally allow that--

01:13:49.508 --> 01:13:50.634
But you can, right?

01:13:51.218 --> 01:13:53.178
Sure, we'll let you in this once.

01:13:55.514 --> 01:13:56.682
Thank you.

01:14:00.227 --> 01:14:01.395
Thank you.

01:14:07.443 --> 01:14:08.444
Let's go.

01:14:19.329 --> 01:14:21.915
What? Do I look like some kind of thug?

01:14:27.921 --> 01:14:31.925
I film in dangerous places
and sell the footage to TV networks.

01:14:32.509 --> 01:14:34.553
That's what I do. I'm a freelancer.

01:14:35.304 --> 01:14:37.681
So it's like… undercover journalism?

01:14:37.764 --> 01:14:39.099
That's it. Undercover.

01:14:39.183 --> 01:14:41.226
Somewhere along the way,
I got some tattoos,

01:14:41.310 --> 01:14:43.812
got stabbed a couple of times,
and tortured a little.

01:14:43.896 --> 01:14:44.897
All for nothing.

01:14:44.980 --> 01:14:46.565
I put my life on the line,

01:14:47.065 --> 01:14:48.567
but no one acknowledged me,

01:14:48.650 --> 01:14:51.570
and those network assholes
made all the fucking money.

01:14:51.653 --> 01:14:53.363
It wasn't fun anymore.

01:14:54.531 --> 01:14:55.908
So I'm gonna do my own thing.

01:14:55.991 --> 01:14:58.869
Something spicy that will shake
Korea to its core, you know.

01:15:00.704 --> 01:15:03.081
Should I look into noise issues
between floors?

01:15:03.165 --> 01:15:04.666
We've both experienced it.

01:15:05.918 --> 01:15:07.419
You really want to kill them,

01:15:07.920 --> 01:15:08.754
don't you?

01:15:10.214 --> 01:15:11.048
Yes.

01:15:12.090 --> 01:15:13.634
I really want to kill them.

01:15:14.885 --> 01:15:15.761
Right?

01:15:22.851 --> 01:15:25.729
Man, I'm tired.
Probably because I haven't slept.

01:15:26.438 --> 01:15:28.106
I think I'll head home now.

01:15:28.190 --> 01:15:29.441
Take your time and enjoy.

01:15:29.942 --> 01:15:31.818
All right. I'll be out in a bit.

01:16:03.559 --> 01:16:06.311
This damn motherfucker.

01:16:41.805 --> 01:16:44.016
THE FACE OF A GENERATION'S STRUGGLE?

01:16:44.099 --> 01:16:46.101
FRAME AS GENERATIONAL ISSUE
MAKE IT BLOW UP

01:16:57.738 --> 01:16:59.323
NOH WOO-SUNG
ALL-IN BUYER

01:17:00.073 --> 01:17:02.451
FRAME HIM AS A VICTIM OF THE SYSTEM
INFO ON GTX STATION

01:17:02.951 --> 01:17:04.161
ROOM WITH A STEEL DOOR?

01:17:04.244 --> 01:17:05.245
JEON EUN-HWA

01:17:05.329 --> 01:17:06.830
I THINK I'VE FOUND A RABBIT HOLE

01:17:06.913 --> 01:17:07.873
PROSECUTOR JEON EUN-HWA

01:17:08.373 --> 01:17:09.374
HER TRUE COLORS

01:17:10.208 --> 01:17:11.668
NOISE-RELATED CRIME ON THE RISE

01:17:12.210 --> 01:17:14.504
PROSECUTORS SEIZE BRIBERY RECORD
SHODDY CONSTRUCTION

01:17:35.067 --> 01:17:36.443
DIGITAL HACKING EXPERT

01:17:37.486 --> 01:17:38.945
ROYAL CITY SILEO
BUILDING 118

01:17:40.364 --> 01:17:41.907
SMART WALL PANEL CONTROLLER

01:17:41.990 --> 01:17:43.492
APARTMENT 1401

01:17:47.245 --> 01:17:48.330
APARTMENT 1501

01:17:48.413 --> 01:17:49.956
Giddy up. Isn't that fun?

01:17:50.040 --> 01:17:52.709
When he says to do as he would…

01:17:52.793 --> 01:17:54.127
I'm gonna go backwards.

01:17:54.211 --> 01:17:55.712
APARTMENT 1501

01:18:00.258 --> 01:18:02.302
FRONT DOOR

01:18:39.089 --> 01:18:40.132
Damn it.

01:18:48.348 --> 01:18:49.808
So he mixed up the keys.

01:18:51.560 --> 01:18:52.686
Dumb piece of shit.

01:19:34.478 --> 01:19:36.563
I really want to kill them.

01:19:36.646 --> 01:19:37.481
Crazy bastard!

01:19:41.151 --> 01:19:44.654
- The camera loves him.
- When I said that, he pulled out a knife.

01:19:44.738 --> 01:19:46.948
- I'm worried for my children.
- This is great.

01:19:47.032 --> 01:19:50.118
He tried to push his way into our home.

01:19:50.202 --> 01:19:53.330
I don't know what he might do,
but he's bound for trouble.

01:19:53.413 --> 01:19:55.290
- Beautifully said.
- The man next door.

01:19:55.373 --> 01:19:57.042
He doesn't seem to be all there.

01:19:57.125 --> 01:19:58.210
1401? He's scary.

01:19:58.293 --> 01:20:01.630
I feel like he could hurt the kids.
He's got murderer vibes.

01:20:01.713 --> 01:20:02.756
Seriously.

01:20:02.839 --> 01:20:03.840
Are you kidding me?

01:20:03.924 --> 01:20:05.592
Everyone out! Get out!

01:20:05.675 --> 01:20:08.720
- You're under arrest for battery.
- That asshole hit him!

01:20:08.804 --> 01:20:11.890
1401 said he'd kill me?
But he's here right now.

01:20:11.973 --> 01:20:12.974
You think I won't?

01:20:13.058 --> 01:20:14.893
I'll find all the fucking evidence here!

01:20:14.976 --> 01:20:16.603
I really want to kill them.

01:20:20.857 --> 01:20:22.108
Man, I'm beat.

01:20:23.902 --> 01:20:24.778
So damn tired.

01:21:02.816 --> 01:21:04.568
INTENSE REVENGE NOISE POLLUTION

01:22:24.105 --> 01:22:25.774
Damn it.

01:22:30.779 --> 01:22:32.072
Do you know what time it is?

01:22:32.155 --> 01:22:33.323
Hey, your shoes.

01:22:33.823 --> 01:22:35.492
Your shoes. Damn it.

01:22:50.882 --> 01:22:52.300
What's gotten into you?

01:22:52.384 --> 01:22:55.095
They say my husband may never wake up.

01:22:56.680 --> 01:22:59.808
I told him to pretend to get hurt,
not to hit his head like an idiot.

01:23:00.392 --> 01:23:02.435
All you had to do was stall for a bit.

01:23:02.519 --> 01:23:05.480
To keep him at the station
until the morning of Liberation Day.

01:23:05.563 --> 01:23:06.940
How can you say that?

01:23:10.110 --> 01:23:11.111
So what do you want?

01:23:11.194 --> 01:23:13.738
You said you'd do anything
to extend your lease.

01:23:13.822 --> 01:23:16.282
You said you needed to stay
because of your kids!

01:23:16.366 --> 01:23:18.660
I told you, my husband is dying.

01:23:19.369 --> 01:23:20.203
Because of you.

01:23:21.913 --> 01:23:23.039
Well, that's great.

01:23:23.790 --> 01:23:25.500
The more deaths, the better.

01:23:26.918 --> 01:23:28.044
More sensational.

01:23:29.754 --> 01:23:31.047
Say that again.

01:23:31.131 --> 01:23:32.215
Say it again!

01:23:35.260 --> 01:23:37.971
You fucked over
a perfectly normal guy for your own good.

01:23:38.471 --> 01:23:40.807
And I'm the only bad guy here?

01:23:41.391 --> 01:23:42.767
You want more money, right?

01:23:43.268 --> 01:23:45.395
Okay. I'll give you some more.

01:23:48.898 --> 01:23:51.609
So just stay put.

01:23:51.693 --> 01:23:53.737
I'll take care of your lease extension.

01:23:55.030 --> 01:23:55.864
Got it?

01:24:10.795 --> 01:24:11.963
Are you insane?

01:24:12.547 --> 01:24:14.799
I spent fucking months
putting this together!

01:24:17.552 --> 01:24:20.930
Do you know how important this is?

01:24:21.014 --> 01:24:23.892
It's the raw truth to save Korea

01:24:23.975 --> 01:24:26.478
from noise complaints! Got it?

01:24:26.978 --> 01:24:28.688
Fucking get it yet?

01:24:34.069 --> 01:24:34.903
Hey.

01:24:35.695 --> 01:24:37.322
Shit, you're not meant to die.

01:24:40.533 --> 01:24:42.744
For fuck's sake.

01:24:42.827 --> 01:24:44.746
I hadn't interviewed her yet.

01:24:45.789 --> 01:24:49.000
Well, that's what you get
for touching my footage.

01:24:51.002 --> 01:24:53.213
Ruined my damn plans.

01:24:53.713 --> 01:24:56.216
All right, fuck it.
Let's finish this today.

01:24:57.717 --> 01:24:58.551
What?

01:24:59.427 --> 01:25:00.512
Why is one missing?

01:25:22.700 --> 01:25:25.078
Hello, police?
I'm calling from Royal City.

01:25:25.161 --> 01:25:28.540
You know the guy who caused
a scene yesterday? Yes, Noh Woo-sung.

01:25:28.623 --> 01:25:30.917
I think he killed his downstairs neighbor.

01:25:31.000 --> 01:25:33.711
He's gone upstairs
to kill the penthouse residents too.

01:26:03.032 --> 01:26:07.287
The noise complaint serial killer,
Noh Woo-sung, was hiding under my bed.

01:26:07.996 --> 01:26:10.039
I think he's trying to kill me too.

01:26:10.999 --> 01:26:12.000
What should I do?

01:26:13.042 --> 01:26:13.960
All right.

01:26:15.128 --> 01:26:16.296
Let me call you back.

01:26:29.642 --> 01:26:30.518
Woo-sung.

01:26:31.269 --> 01:26:32.645
Why would you kill a person

01:26:33.521 --> 01:26:35.106
in someone else's apartment?

01:26:37.692 --> 01:26:39.152
Did you kill her with that?

01:26:40.236 --> 01:26:42.614
What? Are you going to kill me too?

01:26:43.114 --> 01:26:45.533
Hey. Please spare me.

01:26:48.286 --> 01:26:49.579
Fucking psycho.

01:26:50.079 --> 01:26:52.498
Look at the state of this place.
Who'd believe you?

01:26:53.583 --> 01:26:54.709
Everyone will.

01:26:55.501 --> 01:26:58.296
Only you have the motive
to kill the folks downstairs.

01:26:58.922 --> 01:27:00.381
I've made sure of that.

01:27:01.633 --> 01:27:03.593
So you can pin everything on me?

01:27:05.970 --> 01:27:06.804
Hey.

01:27:07.347 --> 01:27:09.015
You planned on killing yourself.

01:27:09.098 --> 01:27:11.893
Wouldn't you rather die
a meaningful death?

01:27:11.976 --> 01:27:13.519
By dying as a murderer?

01:27:14.062 --> 01:27:15.313
Is that meaningful?

01:27:15.396 --> 01:27:17.899
In the broader sense, you're a victim.

01:27:19.025 --> 01:27:22.362
If only they'd built this place properly,
this wouldn't be happening.

01:27:22.946 --> 01:27:26.157
This wouldn't be happening
if you hadn't started this, you sick fuck!

01:27:28.117 --> 01:27:29.369
So it's my fault?

01:27:36.501 --> 01:27:37.335
Hey.

01:27:38.002 --> 01:27:39.003
Take a good look.

01:27:40.755 --> 01:27:43.758
Is this the dream
you've worked your whole life for?

01:27:45.218 --> 01:27:46.344
Is this really it?

01:27:47.553 --> 01:27:48.972
Aren't you even curious?

01:27:49.472 --> 01:27:53.309
Why do people buy apartments for millions
just to suffer noise between floors

01:27:53.393 --> 01:27:55.895
and end up hating, cursing,
and even killing each other?

01:27:55.979 --> 01:27:58.648
I mean, why?
Why won't they build proper buildings?

01:27:58.731 --> 01:28:01.776
Who's embezzling the money,
and who's letting them get away with it?

01:28:01.859 --> 01:28:02.902
Who?

01:28:04.404 --> 01:28:05.905
The truth

01:28:07.115 --> 01:28:08.908
is behind that steel door

01:28:09.409 --> 01:28:11.202
on the top floor of this building.

01:28:12.495 --> 01:28:15.290
Fuck, did I bash my head too hard?

01:28:20.962 --> 01:28:23.965
Then why not just go to the top floor
to begin with?

01:28:24.716 --> 01:28:26.175
Why me?

01:28:26.259 --> 01:28:27.510
Why do you need me?

01:28:27.593 --> 01:28:30.471
I didn't do anything.
Why drag me into this shit show?

01:28:30.555 --> 01:28:32.640
Of all the residents in this building,

01:28:32.724 --> 01:28:34.642
you're best suited for the drama.

01:28:35.268 --> 01:28:37.603
You have a pitiful backstory.

01:28:37.687 --> 01:28:41.316
You are the epitome of pain
suffered by today's young people.

01:28:42.483 --> 01:28:43.651
Right, Mr. All-in?

01:28:44.235 --> 01:28:46.362
You're such a perfect messenger.

01:28:47.530 --> 01:28:50.450
"After maxing out on an apartment,
a man was driven mad by noise,

01:28:50.533 --> 01:28:52.952
killing his neighbors with a hammer,
then himself."

01:28:53.453 --> 01:28:57.582
"Journalist Yeong Jin-ho
miraculously survived the bloodbath

01:28:58.082 --> 01:28:59.917
and uncovered the cause of this tragedy."

01:29:00.001 --> 01:29:01.210
"Poor construction."

01:29:01.294 --> 01:29:04.672
"He held a ledger containing the truth
behind the noise complaints."

01:29:05.298 --> 01:29:08.301
"Journalist Yeong Jin-ho
risked his life to protect the truth,

01:29:08.384 --> 01:29:11.304
and his sincerity changed the world."

01:29:14.223 --> 01:29:15.141
Woo-sung.

01:29:17.310 --> 01:29:18.144
I'll make sure

01:29:18.936 --> 01:29:20.605
your death is put to good use.

01:29:21.981 --> 01:29:23.232
I'm sorry, Woo-sung.

01:29:23.941 --> 01:29:24.776
Jin-ho.

01:29:28.446 --> 01:29:30.073
Wait!

01:29:31.699 --> 01:29:34.202
Please… let me help you.

01:29:34.285 --> 01:29:36.788
My… apartment.

01:29:37.288 --> 01:29:38.956
Just help me get it back.

01:29:39.624 --> 01:29:40.833
Let's do this together.

01:29:40.917 --> 01:29:43.211
You're gonna help me kill people?

01:29:43.294 --> 01:29:47.215
That lady from downstairs
threw a wrench in your plan.

01:29:48.257 --> 01:29:50.927
So now you have to
put an end to this tonight.

01:29:51.969 --> 01:29:53.388
Can you do it alone?

01:29:53.471 --> 01:29:56.349
If you do it alone and fail,
you can kiss the truth goodbye.

01:30:02.230 --> 01:30:04.607
I'm fucking sick of this shit too!

01:30:06.442 --> 01:30:09.028
I want to get my home and my life back.

01:30:09.112 --> 01:30:11.239
We'll send a message out into the world.

01:30:11.322 --> 01:30:13.950
What reason do I have to betray you?

01:30:17.578 --> 01:30:18.913
What about the messenger?

01:30:19.580 --> 01:30:22.458
"A tenant on the verge
of being evicted for noise complaints

01:30:23.251 --> 01:30:25.002
killed her landlord and then herself."

01:30:29.215 --> 01:30:30.425
Not bad.

01:30:30.508 --> 01:30:31.717
But, Woo-sung,

01:30:32.218 --> 01:30:34.011
if things go sideways,

01:30:35.179 --> 01:30:37.640
I'll be paying your mother
a visit in Namhae.

01:30:38.933 --> 01:30:40.393
And I'm gonna need an interview.

01:32:54.569 --> 01:32:55.611
Let me go!

01:32:56.654 --> 01:32:57.530
Please…

01:33:08.916 --> 01:33:10.376
Who the hell are you guys?

01:33:12.003 --> 01:33:14.505
Very well.
Allow me to formally introduce myself.

01:33:14.589 --> 01:33:17.633
I am Yeong Jin-ho, the truth hound.
Nice to meet you.

01:33:18.801 --> 01:33:19.719
What?

01:33:19.802 --> 01:33:22.430
A year ago, when you were a prosecutor,
you stopped a story

01:33:22.513 --> 01:33:25.808
on the poor construction
of this complex from airing.

01:33:25.891 --> 01:33:27.518
I'm the guy who covered that story.

01:33:27.602 --> 01:33:30.605
I put my life on the line for it
and even got stabbed by thugs.

01:33:30.688 --> 01:33:32.690
Do you know how it fucking sucks

01:33:32.773 --> 01:33:34.775
to have your story killed
by undue pressure?

01:33:35.484 --> 01:33:36.777
There was no pressure.

01:33:37.528 --> 01:33:38.904
We were still investigating--

01:33:38.988 --> 01:33:41.824
I'd been digging up dirt on you
ever since then.

01:33:41.907 --> 01:33:44.744
But then, you suddenly quit
your post as a prosecutor

01:33:44.827 --> 01:33:48.456
and started buying up these apartments,
knowing all about the poor construction.

01:33:48.539 --> 01:33:50.166
So I followed you in.

01:33:50.249 --> 01:33:54.045
I thought I'd find something interesting
if I lived close to you.

01:33:54.920 --> 01:33:57.465
There must be
some kind of misunderstanding.

01:33:57.548 --> 01:33:59.717
Now, time for a question.

01:33:59.800 --> 01:34:01.177
Where is the ledger?

01:34:06.265 --> 01:34:08.184
It's behind that steel door, isn't it?

01:34:10.436 --> 01:34:11.354
Ledger?

01:34:12.688 --> 01:34:15.524
Okay, I'll ask again.
Please listen carefully.

01:34:15.608 --> 01:34:19.362
The ledger of the dirty money you
and your inspector husband took and spent.

01:34:19.445 --> 01:34:22.156
That pretty list is
known to bear the names of every dickhead

01:34:22.239 --> 01:34:24.909
who's involved
in shoddy constructions in Korea.

01:34:25.743 --> 01:34:26.786
That ledger.

01:34:27.578 --> 01:34:28.496
Where is it?

01:34:30.206 --> 01:34:32.124
What on earth are you talking about?

01:34:36.420 --> 01:34:37.380
Prosecutor Jeon.

01:34:38.047 --> 01:34:40.174
I heard you discussing it
with your husband.

01:34:40.800 --> 01:34:42.968
You covered the camera but not the mic.

01:34:43.552 --> 01:34:44.595
On the intercom.

01:34:46.347 --> 01:34:50.017
You held on to it to cover your ass
for brokering shoddy construction.

01:34:50.101 --> 01:34:52.812
You said it was like
an impenetrable shield.

01:34:52.895 --> 01:34:53.729
So,

01:34:54.522 --> 01:34:57.733
that impenetrable shield
is behind that steel door, yes?

01:34:58.943 --> 01:34:59.985
I said I don't know!

01:35:00.069 --> 01:35:00.903
You fucking--

01:35:00.986 --> 01:35:01.904
My husband!

01:35:04.198 --> 01:35:05.324
He would know.

01:35:05.408 --> 01:35:06.534
Only he uses that room.

01:35:07.410 --> 01:35:11.330
I honestly have no idea what's inside
or what he does in there.

01:35:12.957 --> 01:35:15.459
Okay. Time to do some fact-checking.

01:35:15.543 --> 01:35:16.919
Keep a close eye on her.

01:35:17.795 --> 01:35:18.963
All right.

01:35:19.714 --> 01:35:21.590
Let's go. Come on.

01:35:23.008 --> 01:35:25.136
Goodness. You've had one too many.

01:35:27.471 --> 01:35:28.472
All right.

01:35:32.268 --> 01:35:33.644
Okay.

01:35:34.145 --> 01:35:37.273
Woo-sung, I was too harsh on you earlier.

01:35:38.232 --> 01:35:41.110
I'm sorry.
But even at a glance, I can tell.

01:35:41.193 --> 01:35:43.821
You're doing this against your will.

01:35:44.488 --> 01:35:47.700
You're being threatened somehow,
aren't you?

01:35:47.783 --> 01:35:48.951
The lady downstairs died.

01:35:50.369 --> 01:35:51.203
What? How?

01:35:53.539 --> 01:35:56.459
He tried to kill me, too,
so I pretended I was on his side.

01:35:57.084 --> 01:35:58.377
I'll help you.

01:36:01.046 --> 01:36:03.591
Right? I knew you would.

01:36:03.674 --> 01:36:05.092
You made the right decision.

01:36:05.676 --> 01:36:08.345
If you help me,
I'll sort everything out for you.

01:36:08.846 --> 01:36:10.139
The air gun in your study.

01:36:10.681 --> 01:36:12.099
- It actually works, right?
- Yes.

01:36:12.683 --> 01:36:14.059
Try to do something with that.

01:36:14.935 --> 01:36:16.729
I'm not helping you because I like you.

01:36:16.812 --> 01:36:18.731
You still need to pay for your crimes.

01:36:18.814 --> 01:36:21.984
I told you it wasn't me.
I'm not that kind of person.

01:36:22.067 --> 01:36:23.903
Do you really believe that murderer?

01:36:25.196 --> 01:36:26.989
Please, save me.

01:36:27.698 --> 01:36:28.783
Help me.

01:36:28.866 --> 01:36:31.494
- I'll give you your apartment back and--
- What the fuck?

01:36:33.829 --> 01:36:35.080
These motherfuckers.

01:36:35.164 --> 01:36:37.792
What is that?
What the fuck is that? Come here!

01:36:37.875 --> 01:36:39.126
Fucking come with me!

01:36:42.004 --> 01:36:44.840
Is this it? Is this all there fucking is?

01:36:45.424 --> 01:36:46.383
Where is it?

01:36:47.426 --> 01:36:49.428
Tell me, you fucking bitch!

01:36:49.512 --> 01:36:51.347
Is this all there fucking is?

01:36:53.390 --> 01:36:55.976
Is this everything in the fucking safe?
Where is it?

01:36:56.060 --> 01:36:57.269
Where the fuck is it?

01:36:57.812 --> 01:36:58.646
I'm sorry.

01:36:58.729 --> 01:37:01.982
I embezzled the maintenance funds
and took bribes from the contractors.

01:37:02.066 --> 01:37:04.610
That was wrong.
But this isn't right. Please let me live.

01:37:04.693 --> 01:37:06.529
- I'll get punished--
- You fucking bitch!

01:37:06.612 --> 01:37:09.031
Don't try to trick me,
you fucking assholes!

01:37:09.532 --> 01:37:11.283
There's no fucking way!

01:37:11.784 --> 01:37:15.246
Get the fuck up, you son of a bitch.
Tell me, motherfucker!

01:37:15.329 --> 01:37:18.082
Where is it? Where is the damn ledger?

01:37:22.962 --> 01:37:25.089
Fuck it. We all die today.

01:37:25.172 --> 01:37:27.216
Where's the fucking ledger?

01:37:28.050 --> 01:37:28.884
Where is it?

01:37:29.885 --> 01:37:31.053
That's all I need.

01:37:31.554 --> 01:37:33.973
Where is it? Where is the ledger?

01:37:35.432 --> 01:37:37.685
Tell me. This is where the truth is.

01:37:38.352 --> 01:37:39.395
Right?

01:37:57.079 --> 01:37:58.789
You pathetic little shit.

01:38:00.207 --> 01:38:01.750
How dare you take their side.

01:38:03.794 --> 01:38:06.297
You fucking moron!

01:38:07.089 --> 01:38:08.215
You fucker.

01:38:08.716 --> 01:38:11.176
Fucking piece of shit.
You fucking traitor.

01:38:11.260 --> 01:38:13.220
Just die, you fucker!

01:38:13.304 --> 01:38:14.930
You fucking bastards!

01:38:35.034 --> 01:38:37.286
Go get him. Catch him and kill him.

01:38:37.786 --> 01:38:39.622
Okay. That son of a bitch!

01:38:40.456 --> 01:38:41.540
He's fucking dead.

01:38:41.624 --> 01:38:43.626
We can't let him live! Get him!

01:38:43.709 --> 01:38:45.544
Hey, you bastard!

01:38:46.503 --> 01:38:48.589
Ma'am!

01:38:50.549 --> 01:38:53.469
Ma'am, please! Open the door.

01:38:58.515 --> 01:39:01.435
Die!

01:40:05.207 --> 01:40:06.667
What the hell?

01:40:25.519 --> 01:40:26.437
Kill him.

01:40:30.107 --> 01:40:31.108
I said kill him.

01:40:35.487 --> 01:40:38.866
Let's just stop here
and hand him over to the police.

01:40:39.992 --> 01:40:41.910
Two people are dead.

01:40:42.786 --> 01:40:44.496
Who will take responsibility?

01:40:47.416 --> 01:40:48.959
If you just let him go,

01:40:50.335 --> 01:40:52.463
you'll end up taking the fall
for everything.

01:40:57.634 --> 01:40:58.510
Hey.

01:41:01.388 --> 01:41:02.639
Don't worry about it.

01:41:03.432 --> 01:41:04.808
That will never happen.

01:41:04.892 --> 01:41:06.727
I'll take care of everything,

01:41:07.478 --> 01:41:08.437
so trust me

01:41:09.313 --> 01:41:10.189
and kill him.

01:41:10.689 --> 01:41:13.150
Please… get it together.

01:41:14.234 --> 01:41:15.277
You can't trust her.

01:41:15.360 --> 01:41:16.779
Kill him.

01:41:18.697 --> 01:41:19.656
Woo-sung.

01:41:19.740 --> 01:41:21.033
Do it!

01:41:47.184 --> 01:41:49.645
You missed your chance, you moron!

01:41:50.854 --> 01:41:52.106
You useless shit!

01:41:55.692 --> 01:41:57.402
You indecisive piece of shit!

01:42:06.578 --> 01:42:08.831
This is why people live
in nice neighborhoods.

01:42:09.414 --> 01:42:11.333
This place is swarming with scum.

01:42:11.834 --> 01:42:14.169
What the hell is this mess?

01:42:20.801 --> 01:42:22.010
I told you

01:42:23.178 --> 01:42:25.389
that we should vet our tenants.

01:42:28.475 --> 01:42:29.518
So it's you.

01:42:30.310 --> 01:42:31.937
I heard there was a psycho.

01:42:33.897 --> 01:42:36.108
Is this what you crawled in here for?

01:42:42.072 --> 01:42:43.949
I overlooked this.

01:42:49.413 --> 01:42:52.541
I wonder why you idiots failed
to hear us mention the ledger is here.

01:42:57.963 --> 01:43:00.340
This? What were you gonna do with this?

01:43:01.049 --> 01:43:04.595
If you released this, would I suddenly
become the noise offender?

01:43:04.678 --> 01:43:07.806
Or did you honestly hope
to change the world?

01:43:11.935 --> 01:43:12.811
So what?

01:43:14.354 --> 01:43:17.191
Would fixing poor construction
and building solid apartments

01:43:17.274 --> 01:43:18.525
solve noise complaints?

01:43:19.193 --> 01:43:20.819
Not a chance.

01:43:21.528 --> 01:43:23.322
Like I told you,

01:43:23.405 --> 01:43:25.657
noise between floors is a human problem.

01:43:25.741 --> 01:43:27.868
Why blame the building?

01:43:30.037 --> 01:43:33.207
If they foolishly overspend
on building sturdier buildings,

01:43:33.707 --> 01:43:35.375
apartment prices would rise.

01:43:35.876 --> 01:43:40.130
That would only make it more difficult
for people like you to afford a home.

01:43:40.756 --> 01:43:42.341
Why don't you get that?

01:43:45.219 --> 01:43:46.803
You know,

01:43:48.096 --> 01:43:50.057
life can't run on hope.

01:43:51.308 --> 01:43:53.518
You need to be realistic.

01:43:55.187 --> 01:43:57.564
But so much for that in this life.

01:43:59.107 --> 01:44:00.984
Better luck in your next one.

01:44:04.321 --> 01:44:05.781
How about no?

01:44:43.527 --> 01:44:45.279
Well, fuck.

01:44:45.821 --> 01:44:47.197
Held my breath for so long.

01:44:48.407 --> 01:44:49.658
Hey, dipshit.

01:44:51.451 --> 01:44:52.577
Didn't I tell you?

01:44:53.495 --> 01:44:54.454
The ledger.

01:44:54.538 --> 01:44:56.581
It's right fucking here…

01:44:59.418 --> 01:45:00.252
Hey.

01:45:01.086 --> 01:45:02.045
Get the ledger.

01:45:02.671 --> 01:45:06.466
Get your shit together
and bring me the ledger.

01:45:08.844 --> 01:45:09.761
That's it.

01:45:13.432 --> 01:45:14.391
That's it.

01:45:28.280 --> 01:45:29.906
For fuck's sake.

01:45:30.615 --> 01:45:32.701
Do you even know what you're looking at?

01:45:32.784 --> 01:45:35.329
Bring it here.

01:45:36.371 --> 01:45:38.290
PROPERTY (APARTMENT) LEASE CONTRACT

01:45:42.669 --> 01:45:44.421
PROPERTY PURCHASE CONTRACT

01:45:57.934 --> 01:45:58.852
What are you doing?

01:46:01.521 --> 01:46:02.814
PROPERTY PURCHASE CONTRACT

01:46:04.107 --> 01:46:05.025
NOH WOO-SUNG

01:46:06.068 --> 01:46:07.569
You bastard.

01:46:08.153 --> 01:46:10.238
Okay, you got your home back.

01:46:10.322 --> 01:46:12.115
Good for you, asshole.

01:46:15.118 --> 01:46:16.370
Burn everything

01:46:17.287 --> 01:46:18.663
except for the ledger.

01:46:20.082 --> 01:46:21.875
Burn this place down. Damn it.

01:46:25.545 --> 01:46:26.380
That's it.

01:46:26.463 --> 01:46:28.006
Bring that here.

01:46:30.675 --> 01:46:32.594
Hey. Damn it.

01:46:36.431 --> 01:46:39.017
Give me the ledger, you bastard.

01:46:39.976 --> 01:46:41.019
What are you doing?

01:46:45.107 --> 01:46:46.733
No.

01:46:46.817 --> 01:46:48.485
Just do exactly as I say.

01:46:49.569 --> 01:46:50.779
Hey, what are you doing?

01:46:50.862 --> 01:46:52.531
What do you think you're doing?

01:46:55.575 --> 01:46:57.202
Stop telling me…

01:47:01.623 --> 01:47:03.041
Stop telling me

01:47:03.125 --> 01:47:05.377
what to do.

01:47:07.796 --> 01:47:10.132
You motherfuckers.

01:47:15.095 --> 01:47:18.098
NOH WOO-SUNG

01:49:12.003 --> 01:49:12.837
CASE REPORT

01:49:25.809 --> 01:49:28.103
So they think I'm some moron?

01:49:29.604 --> 01:49:32.357
I should just cover this up?
Are they serious?

01:49:33.733 --> 01:49:35.110
Do I look like a moron?

01:49:41.741 --> 01:49:43.994
There was a mention of
Jeon Eun-hwa's ledgers

01:49:44.077 --> 01:49:46.788
in Yeong Jin-ho's videos,
but we can't confirm anything

01:49:46.871 --> 01:49:48.999
because everything was burned to a crisp.

01:49:49.082 --> 01:49:50.041
Did you see anything?

01:49:51.585 --> 01:49:53.086
Right, I guess not.

01:49:53.753 --> 01:49:55.171
All right, then. Yeah.

01:49:58.800 --> 01:50:01.678
So whatever Yeong Jin-ho was looking for…

01:50:05.765 --> 01:50:07.017
never existed.

01:50:08.351 --> 01:50:09.227
Right?

01:50:33.918 --> 01:50:35.712
NAMHAE

01:51:33.436 --> 01:51:36.314
Don't think about anything
and rest here for a while.

01:51:36.815 --> 01:51:39.943
No, you can just live here with me,

01:51:40.026 --> 01:51:43.530
so don't even think about
returning to Seoul for a while.

01:51:44.030 --> 01:51:44.864
Okay?

01:51:54.666 --> 01:51:57.085
NOH WOO-SUNG

01:53:15.079 --> 01:53:18.249
PROPERTY REGISTRATION NOTICE

01:53:26.216 --> 01:53:30.553
HOLDER: NOH WOO-SUNG

01:56:49.335 --> 01:56:54.340
Subtitle translation by: Jimin Choi
